WEBVTT

01:28.004 --> 01:28.922
Why?

01:29.464 --> 01:32.092
Why do you get in my way, Julius?!

01:32.175 --> 01:36.596
Because what you're trying to do
is wrong, Conrad.

01:38.765 --> 01:40.016
You must give up.

01:40.100 --> 01:42.685
You don't have enough magic
left in you to resist--

01:42.769 --> 01:44.312
The one who's wrong…

01:46.815 --> 01:48.775
is you!

02:25.687 --> 02:26.521
That sword!

02:27.730 --> 02:29.482
The Imperial Sword, Elsdocia!

02:41.244 --> 02:43.037
<i>He shortened his own life?</i>

02:50.753 --> 02:53.423
I must create it.

02:58.011 --> 03:01.014
A world where everyone respects each other

03:01.097 --> 03:03.474
and laughs with one another!

03:04.517 --> 03:08.396
How could I be wrong
to want such a world?!

03:13.818 --> 03:15.570
Is this for real?

03:40.511 --> 03:42.805
Because there is no future
where you're headed.

03:56.194 --> 03:59.989
Even you deny me?!

04:01.282 --> 04:03.826
If you seal me right now,

04:03.910 --> 04:06.329
you'll lose access to the Imperial Sword!

04:06.996 --> 04:09.791
It does pain us
to lose our national treasure.

04:10.416 --> 04:15.129
But we no longer have
enough power to get it back.

04:15.713 --> 04:18.132
I take full responsibility for this

04:18.216 --> 04:20.468
as the next Wizard King.

04:26.182 --> 04:29.519
I won't give up. I will not, Julius!

04:29.602 --> 04:32.105
Never giving up is my…

05:27.410 --> 05:31.748
SWORD OF THE WIZARD KING

05:41.007 --> 05:43.509
CLOVER KINGDOM

06:19.337 --> 06:20.838
Welcome, everyone,

06:20.922 --> 06:24.050
to the festival of magic battles
that takes place once a decade,

06:24.133 --> 06:25.176
the Triumph!

06:27.428 --> 06:31.057
The Triumph is a tournament of duels

06:31.140 --> 06:34.685
to decide the strongest Magic Knight!

06:35.269 --> 06:37.063
It's long been said

06:37.146 --> 06:39.190
that the mage who wins this tournament

06:39.273 --> 06:41.609
would eventually be chosen
as the Wizard King!

06:43.694 --> 06:45.321
As you know,

06:45.405 --> 06:48.574
there are nine Magic Knights Squads
consisting of mages

06:48.658 --> 06:50.576
who specialize in battle.

06:50.660 --> 06:52.787
And under the direction
of the Wizard King,

06:52.870 --> 06:56.541
the strongest mages
from the top Magic Knights Squad

06:56.624 --> 06:59.669
protect the peace
of the Clover Kingdom every day.

07:00.211 --> 07:03.047
We will determine
the strongest member of the Magic Knights.

07:03.131 --> 07:06.342
Today is sure to be a memorable day!

07:07.135 --> 07:09.178
Thank you for waiting.

07:09.262 --> 07:10.763
The Triumph commences…

07:13.808 --> 07:16.227
Now! Shall we?

07:29.866 --> 07:31.200
By the way, Klaus,

07:31.284 --> 07:34.078
why were we chosen
as the masters of the ceremony?

07:34.162 --> 07:37.331
Because we're members
of the strongest Magic Knights Squad,

07:37.415 --> 07:39.000
the Golden Dawn Squad, of course!

07:39.083 --> 07:41.752
Turn off the Amplification Magic first
before you talk!

07:41.836 --> 07:43.588
Oh my, it totally slipped my mind!

07:43.671 --> 07:46.215
Well… pardon the belated introduction.

07:46.299 --> 07:49.093
My name is Mimosa Vermillion,
and I'll be your commentator.

07:49.177 --> 07:50.761
This here is Klaus.

07:50.845 --> 07:54.056
Now is not the time
for introducing ourselves!

07:54.140 --> 07:57.310
Who in the world
chose Mimosa as a commentator?

07:57.393 --> 07:59.812
But, man, look at all these people.

07:59.896 --> 08:01.772
It's almost a full house.

08:02.565 --> 08:04.859
Of course it is. Because, you see…

08:13.910 --> 08:15.077
Yuno, my love!

08:18.664 --> 08:23.836
In the first round is Yuno,
the vice captain of the Golden Dawn Squad.

08:25.254 --> 08:30.009
Hooray, hooray, Yuno! Go, go, Yuno!

08:30.092 --> 08:33.721
So Pretty Boy is in the first round.

08:33.804 --> 08:35.932
Of course, everyone wants to see him.

08:36.015 --> 08:36.933
Right?

08:37.517 --> 08:40.603
I only want to see
my dearest little sister, Marie.

08:41.187 --> 08:43.356
As expected from Gauche…

08:43.439 --> 08:46.025
Man, I'm so ready to fight too!

08:46.108 --> 08:48.110
I wish Asta could have joined us.

08:48.194 --> 08:52.615
He's in exile because of the demon trial.

08:52.698 --> 08:54.158
What a drag.

08:54.242 --> 08:56.369
Why am I even on the roster?

08:56.452 --> 08:57.912
Go for it!

08:57.995 --> 08:59.872
Oh, here he comes!

09:00.706 --> 09:01.707
What's that?

09:02.959 --> 09:04.460
Hey, who the hell is that?

09:07.588 --> 09:10.174
Up against Yuno is, um…

09:11.759 --> 09:13.678
"the Masked One"?

09:13.761 --> 09:17.014
There's no way you could enter
with such a ridiculous name…

09:17.098 --> 09:18.140
Oh, you're right.

09:19.308 --> 09:21.394
What's with their getup?

09:21.978 --> 09:24.146
Mocking Yuno, are they?

09:25.731 --> 09:28.192
Festival of magic battles, the Triumph.

09:28.276 --> 09:31.571
The first round is
Yuno vs. the Masked One.

09:31.654 --> 09:32.655
The match begins!

09:51.048 --> 09:52.800
Attaboy, Asta!

09:56.387 --> 09:58.681
The first attack is by Yuno!

09:58.764 --> 10:00.975
He used strong Wind Magic,

10:01.058 --> 10:03.352
but the Masked One cut it in half,

10:03.436 --> 10:05.396
completely neutralizing it!

10:05.980 --> 10:07.690
I guess it's begun.

10:24.206 --> 10:28.586
Well then, Julius, shall we begin as well?

10:28.669 --> 10:30.129
Uh-huh!

10:30.212 --> 10:33.132
Barrier Magic, "Voodoo Shangrila"!

10:42.224 --> 10:45.519
What is this enormous magical power?!

10:45.603 --> 10:48.773
You have no idea how long
I've been waiting for this day.

10:49.398 --> 10:53.402
Today, I will change this country!

11:16.676 --> 11:20.930
How fragile you look, Julius.

11:21.013 --> 11:25.393
I absorbed only a little bit of magic,
and this is the toll it takes on you?

11:27.144 --> 11:29.605
I never expected to meet you again.

11:30.231 --> 11:32.108
<i>I see. So, back then, you…</i>

11:32.191 --> 11:35.903
<i>Yes, I hope</i>
<i>you didn't mind me breaking the seal.</i>

11:35.986 --> 11:39.907
<i>You were distracted for a second.</i>

11:40.991 --> 11:42.493
And are you still…?

11:42.993 --> 11:47.164
My ambition
has not changed a bit since then.

11:47.873 --> 11:50.376
I must create a world

11:50.459 --> 11:52.837
where everyone can respect each other

11:52.920 --> 11:55.047
and laugh with one another.

11:55.589 --> 11:57.216
And for that…

11:57.299 --> 12:01.053
My soldiers, it's time for domination.

12:01.137 --> 12:04.432
We shall overthrow the Clover Kingdom!

12:05.057 --> 12:07.768
Legion Magic: Gehenna Game.

12:26.829 --> 12:28.372
Stop it, Conrad!

12:51.312 --> 12:52.271
All right, old man?

12:52.354 --> 12:55.024
Oh, thank you!

13:00.571 --> 13:01.822
Everyone, this way!

13:01.906 --> 13:04.033
Steel Magic: Fierce Spiral Lance!

13:08.537 --> 13:10.706
Klaus, leave this to me!

13:27.264 --> 13:30.184
Why am I being targeted?!

13:34.855 --> 13:35.689
Yuno!

13:36.315 --> 13:39.652
Jeez, what's up with these guys?!
They totally ruined my perfect disguise!

13:39.735 --> 13:43.364
Here I thought you were some lost kid
from the festival who wandered in.

13:43.447 --> 13:44.949
Who are you calling a kid?!

13:45.032 --> 13:47.451
Water Creation Magic: Sea Dragon's Roar!

13:48.285 --> 13:49.286
Whoa!

13:49.370 --> 13:51.038
Stupid Asta!

13:51.121 --> 13:53.374
You could have told me
you were participating!

13:53.457 --> 13:54.458
Noelle!

13:54.542 --> 13:56.460
I know you probably can't feel it,

13:56.544 --> 14:00.130
but it seems like everyone here
is getting their magical power absorbed.

14:00.214 --> 14:02.800
Those with little magical power
are unable to move!

14:02.883 --> 14:05.678
Oh no, really?! Are you okay?

14:05.761 --> 14:07.221
I'm a royal!

14:07.304 --> 14:10.307
A little loss of magic is nothing to me!

14:10.391 --> 14:11.809
Well then, that just means

14:11.892 --> 14:14.687
I'll have to work harder than anyone here!

14:15.187 --> 14:17.356
Don't get too carried away.

14:17.439 --> 14:19.149
I got your back!

14:19.733 --> 14:21.861
You just need to look ahead!

14:21.944 --> 14:23.863
Yeah! Thanks!

14:52.266 --> 14:53.976
Those three?

14:54.059 --> 14:56.353
But that's impossible!

14:56.437 --> 14:59.440
You must know them
if you're a Wizard King.

14:59.523 --> 15:01.984
Those three who had their status
as Wizard King revoked

15:02.067 --> 15:04.612
because of their austerity and cruelty…

15:05.195 --> 15:07.781
Who the heck are you?! Is this your doing?

15:07.865 --> 15:10.743
What's with this child?
How come he can move?

15:10.826 --> 15:11.994
Uh-huh?

15:12.077 --> 15:15.164
He doesn't have
any magical power to begin with.

15:15.247 --> 15:18.167
No juice to speak of, huh? What a weirdo.

15:18.250 --> 15:23.380
There is no way my soldiers would be
defeated by someone with no magic.

15:23.464 --> 15:25.174
How interesting.

15:25.257 --> 15:31.639
I managed to revive them with my magic
and the power of the Imperial Sword.

15:35.768 --> 15:40.689
Unlike you, those three have become
great supporters of my cause.

15:41.607 --> 15:44.318
The four of us will create a new world!

15:44.401 --> 15:46.028
That's right.

15:46.111 --> 15:47.947
And you're in our way.

15:48.030 --> 15:51.116
Say what?!
I don't know what exactly you're up to,

15:51.200 --> 15:53.619
but I know that you're the bad guys!

15:53.702 --> 15:55.287
I will defeat you!

15:55.371 --> 15:57.247
Aren't you a lively one?

15:58.332 --> 16:00.834
Barrier Magic: Voodoo Regalia!

16:07.091 --> 16:09.134
<i>He neutralized magic?</i>

16:11.345 --> 16:15.265
Conrad, I found a new toy you might like.

16:15.349 --> 16:17.601
You wanna play?

16:23.983 --> 16:25.859
Wizard King, are you all right?!

16:25.943 --> 16:28.195
No, Marx! Stay back!

16:29.738 --> 16:32.366
Well, well, that's interesting magic.

16:33.617 --> 16:36.662
Huh, so he's not gonna answer me.

16:36.745 --> 16:38.789
I take it I should do whatever I want?

16:38.872 --> 16:41.291
Do not hurt him unnecessarily.

16:41.375 --> 16:43.752
Have the decency
to finish him in one blow.

16:44.378 --> 16:45.879
Hey, my toy!

16:51.051 --> 16:52.761
-Asta!
-La!

16:52.845 --> 16:54.680
Thanks, you all!

17:02.521 --> 17:06.066
Oh? Nice magic you got there.

17:06.942 --> 17:10.320
It's useless against a Wizard King.

17:10.404 --> 17:12.531
What can a normal Magic Knight do?

17:13.115 --> 17:17.953
A peasant kid with no magic like him
is a Magic Knight?

17:18.037 --> 17:20.622
It seems things have fallen far, Julius.

17:22.750 --> 17:24.043
I wouldn't be so sure.

17:24.752 --> 17:25.878
Come again?

17:25.961 --> 17:29.089
I don't think we've fallen that much.

17:29.173 --> 17:31.633
Not me, nor the Magic Knights Squads.

17:33.969 --> 17:37.848
Dark Magic: Dark Cloaked
Lightless Blade Storm!

17:56.533 --> 17:57.868
Thanks for waiting!

17:57.951 --> 18:00.788
A strong helper is here to assist you!

18:00.871 --> 18:03.791
Wait, what is this sinister magical power?

18:05.751 --> 18:08.587
It looks like I can paint
another masterpiece based on this!

18:08.670 --> 18:09.797
You're fighting me!

18:09.880 --> 18:12.841
I'll burn you to ashes
with the flame of justice!

18:14.259 --> 18:16.386
That silhouette… You must be…

18:18.347 --> 18:19.973
Kaiser.

18:20.808 --> 18:22.351
It's been a while.

18:23.393 --> 18:24.269
Captain Yami!

18:24.353 --> 18:25.187
My bad.

18:25.270 --> 18:28.440
I was taking a dump,
and it took me a while so I'm late.

18:29.024 --> 18:30.400
And who are these guys?

18:30.984 --> 18:32.277
Not exactly sure,

18:32.361 --> 18:34.113
but I know they're really bad!

18:34.196 --> 18:36.281
And things are really bad too!

18:36.365 --> 18:38.742
For real? Your vocabulary is really bad.

18:38.826 --> 18:40.869
He isn't wrong, you know.

18:41.453 --> 18:43.831
It'd be difficult
to defeat them as we stand.

18:44.331 --> 18:46.333
One possibility would be…

18:46.834 --> 18:48.001
Yami.

18:48.085 --> 18:51.713
Please head to the Magic Tool
Research Lab's Branch Zero right away.

18:51.797 --> 18:54.883
I need you to bring the magic tool
we're co-developing with Nero.

18:56.343 --> 18:58.011
-No, thanks.
-Huh?!

18:58.929 --> 19:02.724
If I went, then who'll have your back?
You're totally vulnerable.

19:03.684 --> 19:06.728
I have no interest in going through
what I did back then again.

19:08.105 --> 19:09.148
Yami…

19:09.231 --> 19:12.276
I mean, if that's all you need,
we can send this guy.

19:12.359 --> 19:14.153
-Hey, kid, you're up.
-Huh?

19:14.736 --> 19:16.989
Yo, Finral. You heard him.

19:17.072 --> 19:18.949
Go to Branch Zero with him.

19:19.032 --> 19:20.117
Yes, sir!

19:20.200 --> 19:22.494
But if I went, this place would be…

19:25.747 --> 19:27.541
So this is where you were hiding.

19:27.624 --> 19:29.543
Stop running around.

19:29.626 --> 19:31.503
I can't kill you swiftly.

19:44.641 --> 19:45.475
Oh?

19:46.059 --> 19:48.395
Stop blubbering and go already!

19:48.478 --> 19:52.065
If you don't come back soon,
I'll kick their butts all by myself!

19:52.149 --> 19:52.983
Yes, sir!

19:57.529 --> 19:58.655
Captain Yami!

19:58.739 --> 20:00.073
Quickly, Asta!

20:00.157 --> 20:04.244
Because of that black barrier,
it's difficult to maintain spatial magic!

20:05.412 --> 20:07.581
You're a member of the Black Bulls Squad!

20:07.664 --> 20:09.124
Listen to your captain!

20:09.208 --> 20:10.626
Nice, Noelle!

20:11.251 --> 20:12.252
Whoa, whoa.

20:12.336 --> 20:15.214
A magic like that exists in this era?

20:15.297 --> 20:18.091
Well, I guess I can analyze it later.

20:18.842 --> 20:19.760
Whoa.

20:23.055 --> 20:24.389
Voiuvre's Roar!

20:29.770 --> 20:33.315
Running away is pointless, I guess.

20:35.025 --> 20:37.486
Dark Magic: Dark Cloaked Black Blade!

20:37.569 --> 20:40.489
Flame Magic: Spiral Flames!

20:48.622 --> 20:51.124
Their defense is getting
harder and harder.

20:51.917 --> 20:53.710
The kids have come far.

20:53.794 --> 20:56.630
No, they've got a long way to go.

20:56.713 --> 20:59.716
A long way to go
before they can fight alongside me.

21:04.805 --> 21:07.432
I'm sorry, I wasn't able to contain them.

21:07.516 --> 21:09.476
No, you've done well.

21:10.018 --> 21:12.980
Thanks to you, I got to send
my guys out on an errand.

21:13.563 --> 21:15.941
Whatever you do, it is pointless.

21:16.024 --> 21:18.402
If the Imperial Sword's magic
is activated,

21:18.485 --> 21:20.821
the Clover Kingdom will be destroyed.

21:21.697 --> 21:24.157
Repeating the same thing
from ten years ago.

21:24.241 --> 21:28.161
Wait, wasn't the Imperial Sword
something that could absorb

21:28.245 --> 21:31.081
and store magical power and stuff?

21:31.873 --> 21:34.710
Is it really possible
to destroy a country with it?

21:35.210 --> 21:38.463
It can unleash
the stored magical power all at once.

21:39.798 --> 21:43.093
Right now, the magical power
absorbed from everyone at the stadium

21:43.176 --> 21:45.137
is stored inside the Imperial Sword.

21:46.305 --> 21:47.597
With his magic,

21:47.681 --> 21:51.518
he could abuse that magical power
and the Imperial Sword as he wishes.

21:52.102 --> 21:55.731
"Abuse"? I'm using it to save the world.

21:55.814 --> 21:58.859
I'd say it's the proper way to use it.

22:07.409 --> 22:09.202
Are you all right, Wizard King?

22:09.286 --> 22:12.289
We have completed
the evacuation of the audience.

22:12.873 --> 22:14.875
All that's left is to defeat the rebels.

22:14.958 --> 22:17.210
Fuegoleon and Nozel.

22:17.294 --> 22:19.379
Have you gotten any stronger?

22:20.422 --> 22:24.468
I never expected to fight
this monster again.

22:25.052 --> 22:26.803
Oh yeah, back then,

22:26.887 --> 22:30.432
Nozel got spooked, fell down,
cried, and soiled his pants, didn't he?

22:30.515 --> 22:32.601
Want me to dunk you in mercury, foreigner?

22:32.684 --> 22:35.187
Hey, those guys weren't there back then.

22:35.270 --> 22:36.146
Who are they?

22:36.229 --> 22:39.399
That woman's magic,
which produces magic soldiers…

22:39.483 --> 22:41.651
I remember seeing it
in my great-grandfather's journal.

22:42.652 --> 22:45.489
My sister was captivated by it,
so I remember it well.

22:45.572 --> 22:46.406
No way!

22:47.115 --> 22:50.160
Historical figures who died long ago…

22:50.243 --> 22:54.164
Wait, does that mean
former Wizard Kings have returned?

22:55.832 --> 22:56.958
Seriously?

22:57.042 --> 22:59.378
I gotta get their autographs
and scalp them.

22:59.461 --> 23:01.713
The former Wizard Kings have been revived?

23:01.797 --> 23:05.008
It's so strange. I'm awake for a change,

23:05.092 --> 23:06.635
but this is like a dream.

23:08.011 --> 23:10.389
It gives me lots of inspiration!

23:11.014 --> 23:13.225
But maybe now's not the time for that.

23:17.562 --> 23:19.773
You seem to have gathered enough people,

23:19.856 --> 23:21.191
but this is where it ends.

23:31.076 --> 23:36.957
There are countless singular points
where veins of mana interact.

23:37.040 --> 23:39.084
This stadium is one of them.

23:40.043 --> 23:41.503
Ten years ago,

23:41.586 --> 23:43.630
I altered this stadium

23:43.713 --> 23:45.298
and turned it into a weapon.

23:46.049 --> 23:49.553
You all interrupted me
before I could activate it.

24:24.254 --> 24:26.006
The festival stadium.

24:26.840 --> 24:30.594
Also known as
the "Triumph" flying fortress.

24:32.262 --> 24:35.015
Now, there's no way to escape.

24:35.098 --> 24:39.769
Julius, it's time to turn the hands
of the clock you took away from me.

24:46.276 --> 24:48.945
Here we are. This is Branch Zero.

24:52.365 --> 24:53.783
Hey!

24:53.867 --> 24:57.537
I'm Asta from
the Black Bulls Magic Knights Squad!

24:57.621 --> 24:58.788
Open the door!

24:58.872 --> 25:00.123
That won't do, Asta.

25:00.832 --> 25:05.253
Only a limited number of nobles
know about this lab.

25:05.879 --> 25:09.007
To enter, you have to spell out
a secret password with your magic…

25:13.512 --> 25:14.346
You are…

25:15.388 --> 25:17.224
You must be the Black Bulls.

25:18.225 --> 25:22.020
I'm Millie Maxwell,
the coordinator at this branch.

25:22.521 --> 25:23.730
Come on, hurry up.

25:23.813 --> 25:25.106
Alright!

25:25.190 --> 25:27.859
We've been debriefed about the situation.

25:28.443 --> 25:30.862
From here on, she will show you around.

25:32.322 --> 25:34.074
I'll leave you to it.

25:34.658 --> 25:35.492
Nero!

25:37.035 --> 25:39.579
The magic tool Julius needs

25:39.663 --> 25:42.082
is stored in a place quite far away.

25:42.582 --> 25:44.709
Right now, Sally is making an adjustment.

25:44.793 --> 25:47.170
Experiment, experiment!

25:48.713 --> 25:50.257
So Sally is here too, huh?

25:50.840 --> 25:53.927
Nero, you've watched the Clover Kingdom

25:54.010 --> 25:56.137
over the last 500 years, right?

25:57.013 --> 26:00.308
Do you know the people
who attacked the stadium?

26:01.476 --> 26:02.727
I'm sorry.

26:02.811 --> 26:05.146
I don't know everything, but…

26:05.981 --> 26:07.983
the mastermind is Conrad Leto.

26:08.066 --> 26:08.942
What?

26:09.025 --> 26:11.403
I believe you've at least heard the name?

26:11.903 --> 26:12.904
Conrad?

26:13.863 --> 26:14.739
You don't mean…

26:17.951 --> 26:18.785
Yes.

26:19.327 --> 26:22.038
He used to be
a Magic Knight of the Clover Kingdom.

26:22.747 --> 26:25.709
He's the predecessor of Julius Novachrono.

26:26.668 --> 26:28.211
A former Wizard King.

26:29.588 --> 26:33.717
But I thought the former Wizard King
died from a disease ten years ago.

26:34.467 --> 26:35.927
I'll explain.

26:37.095 --> 26:37.929
Get on.

26:40.473 --> 26:44.060
Conrad Leto, the 27th Wizard King.

26:44.144 --> 26:46.688
Before he was chosen as the Wizard King,

26:46.771 --> 26:49.482
he was known as a powerful man
in the Clover Kingdom.

26:50.734 --> 26:53.278
<i>He became a Magic Knight captain,</i>

26:53.820 --> 26:57.032
<i>establishing an impressive track record</i>
<i>with his squad.</i>

26:57.532 --> 27:00.118
<i>The citizens trusted him,</i>

27:00.201 --> 27:02.412
<i>and his abilities were recognized.</i>

27:02.495 --> 27:04.831
<i>He was finally chosen</i>
<i>to be the Wizard King.</i>

27:05.665 --> 27:08.001
<i>But he changed.</i>

27:09.336 --> 27:11.338
<i>He rebelled against the Kingdom,</i>

27:11.421 --> 27:14.341
<i>and as a result,</i>
<i>his status as the Wizard King was revoked.</i>

27:14.966 --> 27:16.509
<i>"Rebelled against"?</i>

27:18.845 --> 27:21.181
<i>He tried to destroy the country.</i>

27:21.264 --> 27:24.976
What?! The Wizard King's job
is to protect the peace for everyone.

27:25.060 --> 27:27.479
Why did he try to do something so crazy?

27:28.021 --> 27:28.980
I don't know.

27:29.773 --> 27:31.441
But he used Lemiel's…

27:32.025 --> 27:34.611
<i>He used</i>
<i>the first Wizard King's magic item,</i>

27:34.694 --> 27:37.947
<i>the Imperial Sword Elsdocia,</i>
<i>to make it happen.</i>

27:39.074 --> 27:41.201
<i>Julius and the others learned of his plan</i>

27:41.284 --> 27:42.827
<i>and sealed Conrad to stop him.</i>

27:43.328 --> 27:44.954
"Sealed"?

27:45.038 --> 27:49.084
They announced that he died of an illness
so as not to panic the citizens.

27:49.918 --> 27:51.920
The current Wizard King, Julius,

27:52.003 --> 27:56.549
couldn't defeat him, even with all
the Magic Knights Squad elites.

27:57.342 --> 27:58.677
Julius had no choice

27:58.760 --> 28:02.347
but to use his Time Magic
to continue sealing him.

28:02.430 --> 28:04.391
He's incredibly strong.

28:05.100 --> 28:06.768
What kind of magic does he use?

28:06.851 --> 28:07.727
Key Magic.

28:08.269 --> 28:11.064
He can open or close
anything and everything

28:11.147 --> 28:13.066
with a key he creates with his magic.

28:13.650 --> 28:16.069
The magic space he opens with his key

28:16.152 --> 28:18.196
can absorb anything.

28:18.863 --> 28:20.865
Magic tools, grimoires.

28:21.533 --> 28:22.617
Even magic itself…

28:22.701 --> 28:23.618
Magic itself?!

28:23.702 --> 28:25.745
What? No way!

28:25.829 --> 28:26.663
Yes.

28:27.330 --> 28:29.999
He can steal the magic of others.

28:30.542 --> 28:33.753
And he can use it as he pleases.

28:36.923 --> 28:38.800
Sealing Magic: Inverse Release.

28:53.231 --> 28:54.816
How far are we going?

28:55.358 --> 28:56.860
The security is extremely tight.

28:56.943 --> 28:58.069
Indeed.

28:58.153 --> 28:59.779
Because beyond this point…

29:13.960 --> 29:16.087
This is the innermost part of Branch Zero.

29:16.713 --> 29:20.800
This is where we store and research
the most important magic tools in the lab.

29:21.926 --> 29:25.138
Is what we've been asked to retrieve
also rare?

29:25.221 --> 29:26.055
Yes.

29:26.639 --> 29:28.641
It controls the power
of the Imperial Sword

29:28.725 --> 29:30.685
that Prince Lemiel was developing.

29:31.186 --> 29:33.897
Something that serves as a sheath
for the Imperial Sword.

29:34.606 --> 29:36.232
It's still a prototype,

29:36.316 --> 29:38.777
but we'll have to use it to seal Conrad.

29:46.242 --> 29:47.076
How?!

29:47.911 --> 29:52.540
I had high hopes hearing that
it was a magic tool Lemiel was working on.

29:53.416 --> 29:55.293
But it turns out it was just a toy.

29:57.253 --> 29:59.589
-Don't!
-Sally!

30:00.882 --> 30:02.759
Demon Slayer!

30:07.222 --> 30:08.389
Oh?

30:13.186 --> 30:14.020
Finral!

30:18.983 --> 30:20.443
I know you.

30:24.072 --> 30:25.532
How did you find this place?!

30:26.908 --> 30:29.327
You're Secré Swallowtail,

30:29.410 --> 30:31.913
a member of the Black Bulls Squad.

30:32.413 --> 30:34.082
And you too, Asta.

30:34.707 --> 30:35.834
Noelle Silva.

30:36.417 --> 30:38.211
Finral Roulacase.

30:39.003 --> 30:42.799
Memory Exchange Magic, which allows
you to peek at someone else's memory.

30:43.341 --> 30:45.385
It's a magic of poor taste,

30:45.468 --> 30:48.972
but thanks to that,
I was able to easily locate this place.

30:49.055 --> 30:50.723
You used Marx's…

30:50.807 --> 30:52.725
I'll tell you one more thing.

30:55.854 --> 30:57.939
Citizens of the Clover Kingdom!

30:58.022 --> 31:01.985
Surrender immediately
and offer your magical power as a tribute.

31:02.569 --> 31:03.695
Resistance is futile.

31:04.362 --> 31:06.489
My Legion Magic soldiers

31:06.573 --> 31:09.951
will stop at nothing
until their last bit of power is spent!

31:10.618 --> 31:13.746
<i>One of the former Wizard Kings, Princia.</i>

31:14.581 --> 31:17.917
<i>The Imperial Sword is supplying her</i>
<i>with the magical power it stored,</i>

31:18.001 --> 31:19.669
<i>and her magic will have no limit.</i>

31:20.712 --> 31:23.214
<i>The Magic Knights Squads</i>
<i>have been wiped out.</i>

31:23.298 --> 31:27.218
<i>The citizens and the major facilities</i>
<i>of the kingdom have all been seized.</i>

31:27.802 --> 31:28.970
No way…

31:29.053 --> 31:30.889
Impressive, no?

31:30.972 --> 31:33.016
Tens of thousands…

31:33.099 --> 31:37.228
She can create even more magic soldiers.

31:37.312 --> 31:41.357
You're being invaded by a military power
equal to an entire country.

31:41.441 --> 31:44.402
Those captains who helped you escape…

31:46.237 --> 31:47.739
Captain Yami!

31:50.283 --> 31:54.662
As you can see, they just went to sleep.

31:55.914 --> 31:57.248
The people at the stadium…

31:57.749 --> 31:59.667
Brother Nozel!

32:00.335 --> 32:03.296
You're the youngest daughter
of the Silvas?

32:03.379 --> 32:06.174
A leftover child
of the Steel War Princess,

32:06.257 --> 32:07.675
Acier Silva.

32:07.759 --> 32:12.305
How pathetic of Nozel
to fall before his little sister.

32:13.014 --> 32:14.933
To think that a coward like him

32:15.016 --> 32:17.477
is the Magic Knights Captain!

32:18.770 --> 32:21.272
Sea Dragon's Roar!

32:28.738 --> 32:32.200
Noelle! Dammit!

32:32.951 --> 32:34.077
Oh?

32:34.160 --> 32:37.705
Still rough around the edges,
but this water magic is of high purity.

32:38.289 --> 32:39.666
I will take it.

32:46.673 --> 32:50.385
When there is such a clear difference
in abilities, it's so easy to take magic.

32:53.304 --> 32:56.182
My magic…

33:02.021 --> 33:04.816
Bastard… What did you do to Noelle?!

33:04.899 --> 33:07.443
Learn this the hard way.

33:08.111 --> 33:11.280
Water Creation Magic: Sea Dragon's Roar.

33:18.871 --> 33:21.541
That's Noelle's magic…

33:21.624 --> 33:22.542
Give it back to her!

33:37.849 --> 33:39.892
I'll defeat you here and now!

33:39.976 --> 33:43.396
So this is Anti-Magic,
the power to neutralize magic.

34:27.774 --> 34:29.108
Demon-Destroyer!

34:31.819 --> 34:34.322
What a wonderful power you possess.

34:34.906 --> 34:36.908
It can neutralize not only magic,

34:36.991 --> 34:39.911
but also phenomena derived from magic.

34:40.411 --> 34:42.789
I'd like to take your magic as well,

34:42.872 --> 34:45.166
but perhaps I should refrain.

34:45.917 --> 34:48.419
I wouldn't want it
to affect my other magic.

34:49.087 --> 34:50.546
Let's talk.

34:50.630 --> 34:53.174
The paths we walk are one and the same.

34:53.257 --> 34:55.218
What the heck are you talking about now?!

34:55.301 --> 34:56.385
Of course they're not!

34:57.053 --> 35:00.348
The magic tool developed by Lemiel,
the first Wizard King,

35:00.431 --> 35:02.100
the Imperial Sword Elsdocia.

35:03.184 --> 35:06.312
It is quite compatible with my Key Magic.

35:07.480 --> 35:10.733
<i>The Imperial Sword was created</i>
<i>to leave behind the exceptional magic</i>

35:10.817 --> 35:13.820
<i>of great mages and heroes</i>
<i>as a legacy for future generations.</i>

35:14.320 --> 35:17.406
<i>It stores every Wizard King's magic</i>
<i>and wisdom,</i>

35:17.490 --> 35:20.493
<i>not to mention a part of their souls.</i>

35:21.119 --> 35:22.745
<i>And one more thing.</i>

35:22.829 --> 35:25.581
<i>Using the function to absorb, store,</i>

35:25.665 --> 35:29.001
<i>and unleash the magical power all at once,</i>

35:29.085 --> 35:31.754
<i>I will compound</i>
<i>the generations of Wizard Kings' magic</i>…

35:31.838 --> 35:32.880
FLAME EARTH WATER WIND

35:32.964 --> 35:35.341
<i>…with the plethora of magic I've stolen</i>

35:35.424 --> 35:38.386
<i>and create Gargantuan Compound Magic!</i>

35:38.469 --> 35:43.683
<i>Our goal is to drive that</i>
<i>into the vein of the earth here.</i>

35:45.476 --> 35:47.645
<i>It will cause unprecedented disaster.</i>

35:47.728 --> 35:50.022
<i>The foundation of the continent</i>
<i>will be destroyed,</i>

35:50.106 --> 35:52.525
<i>and every single citizen will die.</i>

35:53.484 --> 35:55.194
But have no fear.

35:55.278 --> 35:58.614
The Imperial Sword
can store the departed souls.

35:58.698 --> 36:00.116
So we will select

36:00.199 --> 36:03.411
and bring back only those people
who are valuable enough

36:03.494 --> 36:05.163
to live in the new world!

36:05.746 --> 36:07.874
I've seen it in people's memories.

36:07.957 --> 36:11.002
I was once loathed
and disliked because of my magic.

36:11.085 --> 36:13.171
So I know exactly how you feel.

36:13.254 --> 36:15.923
Those with magical power own everything,

36:16.007 --> 36:18.801
and those without die helplessly.

36:18.885 --> 36:21.387
It's impossible, Asta.

36:21.470 --> 36:23.556
We must destroy everything first.

36:23.639 --> 36:27.393
Join me and together we'll create

36:27.476 --> 36:32.690
an ideal world where everyone respects
each other and laughs with one another!

36:33.608 --> 36:37.695
Everyone who lives there respects
each other and laughs with one another.

36:37.778 --> 36:40.781
That's the country I want to create
when I become the Wizard King!

36:40.865 --> 36:42.158
No!

36:42.241 --> 36:44.911
That's bullshit!

36:44.994 --> 36:50.416
The Wizard King is there
to protect the nation and its people!

36:50.499 --> 36:52.919
I will not let you destroy it!

36:53.002 --> 36:55.421
That's not what the Wizard King does!

36:56.297 --> 36:59.133
An ideal world will be built
upon the meaningless lives

36:59.217 --> 37:01.427
of those who are oppressed.

37:02.303 --> 37:05.264
I can give meaning to their lives!

37:05.348 --> 37:07.141
Why can't you see that?!

37:08.976 --> 37:13.105
Of course I can't!
What you're saying is absolutely crazy!

37:15.024 --> 37:17.985
You don't see
the true nature of the world yet.

37:18.569 --> 37:19.487
I'm disappointed.

37:20.112 --> 37:21.948
Shut up!

37:22.031 --> 37:25.910
You're just thinking of yourself!

37:35.711 --> 37:37.421
Why can't you understand?!

37:40.675 --> 37:43.094
I know you've experienced it!

37:43.177 --> 37:47.515
The unfairness! The betrayal!
And the inequality of this country!

37:52.520 --> 37:54.105
Choose, Asta.

37:54.188 --> 37:56.274
Walk this path with me

37:57.566 --> 37:59.735
or die.

38:20.798 --> 38:22.717
Give up already, Asta.

38:23.259 --> 38:24.427
You are me.

38:25.177 --> 38:26.846
You can be me.

38:28.306 --> 38:31.726
By dawn tomorrow,
the fusion of magic will be complete.

38:31.809 --> 38:34.103
At that point, you will be…

38:36.981 --> 38:41.986
Give… Noelle back… her magic…

38:44.071 --> 38:44.947
I see.

38:46.198 --> 38:49.118
It's truly regrettable.

38:51.287 --> 38:52.246
I will

38:53.164 --> 38:54.665
not give up.

38:55.916 --> 38:58.210
Never giving up

38:59.211 --> 39:01.630
is my magic!

39:10.890 --> 39:12.558
I have no magical power left.

39:13.392 --> 39:14.435
What do I do?

39:14.518 --> 39:17.396
But we still have to give it a try!

39:29.033 --> 39:30.868
You… you're Yuno!

39:31.869 --> 39:32.870
Millie!

39:32.953 --> 39:35.956
He insisted he came to help you all.

39:36.707 --> 39:37.583
Drink up, Sally!

39:38.334 --> 39:39.627
Okay.

39:41.212 --> 39:43.672
Sorry, but we'll have to play this by ear.

39:44.215 --> 39:45.591
Play it by ear?

39:45.674 --> 39:47.134
Sounds fun!

39:47.760 --> 39:48.677
Not at all.

39:49.387 --> 39:51.597
It's the phrase
I hate the most in the world.

40:15.788 --> 40:18.207
Yuno…

40:23.254 --> 40:26.340
I never thought I'd use it like this,

40:26.424 --> 40:30.219
but let's try and activate it
with all the magic we have!

40:30.302 --> 40:31.595
Nonsense.

40:31.679 --> 40:33.472
It may be. But…

40:33.556 --> 40:35.808
I can hit you thanks to everyone's help!

40:36.684 --> 40:38.811
Sealing Magic: Eternal Prison!

40:47.278 --> 40:48.529
He's a monster!

40:50.114 --> 40:51.157
We'll retreat for now!

41:12.052 --> 41:15.306
It's me. How is the fusion of magic going?

41:15.389 --> 41:18.767
Uh-huh? We're at about 20%.

41:19.268 --> 41:20.978
Generally speaking, it's going well.

41:21.645 --> 41:24.356
<i>It should be completed by dawn,</i>
<i>as scheduled.</i>

41:24.857 --> 41:25.816
Understood.

41:26.400 --> 41:27.902
Thank you.

41:27.985 --> 41:29.987
For walking this path with me.

41:30.654 --> 41:32.114
Finally, we'll create it.

41:32.198 --> 41:33.699
The strongest country

41:33.782 --> 41:36.494
with no tears and where no one
is robbed of what they have!

41:36.577 --> 41:40.873
Once again, save the poor lost souls…

41:41.457 --> 41:47.087
What I seek is a world
where no one oppresses or is oppressed.

41:47.171 --> 41:51.926
<i>I trust that you can achieve that, Conrad.</i>

41:52.760 --> 41:53.594
Yes.

41:54.094 --> 41:55.930
How about the veins?

41:56.514 --> 41:59.892
<i>Uh-huh? I found the perfect one.</i>

42:00.392 --> 42:02.061
<i>It's at a village called Hage,</i>

42:02.144 --> 42:05.814
<i>in the Forsaken Realm</i>
<i>where the demon's skeleton lies.</i>

42:14.198 --> 42:18.786
My Key Magic is useless
unless I borrow someone's power.

42:19.578 --> 42:23.666
That's why it is meaningful
that I'm the one who finishes this.

42:24.166 --> 42:27.586
One day, I will even change this country.

42:31.173 --> 42:34.260
Never giving up is my magic!

42:42.393 --> 42:44.478
Never giving up…

43:03.080 --> 43:03.914
Where am I?

43:05.749 --> 43:07.710
Oh, Noelle!

43:08.752 --> 43:10.462
You're awake.

43:10.546 --> 43:13.132
I'm sorry that all I could provide
was first aid.

43:13.215 --> 43:14.466
Mimosa.

43:15.426 --> 43:16.677
You're safe.

43:21.932 --> 43:25.019
This is a Golden Dawn emergency shelter.

43:25.644 --> 43:27.521
It's still under construction,

43:27.605 --> 43:29.315
so only a few members know about it.

43:29.398 --> 43:34.028
We were almost captured
and our magic stolen,

43:34.111 --> 43:36.196
but the captains let us escape.

43:42.745 --> 43:45.164
Take care of the kid for me.

43:47.374 --> 43:49.793
I don't know what happened afterwards,

43:49.877 --> 43:52.087
but if they're not here yet…

43:55.633 --> 43:56.967
Hey, are you okay?

43:57.051 --> 43:59.219
Asta! Please excuse me.

44:00.429 --> 44:01.430
Asta!

44:01.513 --> 44:03.932
You should not move
until the treatment is over.

44:05.392 --> 44:07.936
Conrad… needs to be stopped.

44:08.729 --> 44:11.065
He's going to destroy this kingdom.

44:11.649 --> 44:12.983
If we don't do something,

44:13.067 --> 44:15.486
it will happen tomorrow at dawn!

44:15.569 --> 44:16.904
At dawn?

44:16.987 --> 44:19.156
But if the enemies are so formidable…

44:19.239 --> 44:21.367
Why would a former Wizard King…

44:21.450 --> 44:23.744
What could we possibly do by ourselves?

44:27.873 --> 44:28.957
What could we do?

44:29.041 --> 44:32.086
Now that it's come to this,
we should run away!

44:32.169 --> 44:34.129
There's nothing we can do with so few,

44:34.213 --> 44:36.507
and who knows when they'll find us here!

44:36.590 --> 44:37.508
Let's run!

44:37.591 --> 44:39.009
To some other country!

44:39.093 --> 44:41.512
Maybe the Heart Kingdom will take us in.

44:42.221 --> 44:45.015
This is not a problem we alone can solve…

44:45.099 --> 44:47.518
Yes, we could ask other nations for help.

44:48.227 --> 44:51.313
There are injured people.
Getting them to the border would be tough.

44:51.397 --> 44:54.692
If the enemy is the former Wizard King,
do we have any chance of winning?

44:54.775 --> 44:56.652
With Julius gone…

44:56.735 --> 44:58.779
What could we do by ourselves?

45:00.739 --> 45:03.534
We gotta do something!

45:03.617 --> 45:05.077
If we cave in,

45:05.160 --> 45:08.497
then who will protect this kingdom
and everyone in it?

45:08.997 --> 45:13.168
Aren't we the Magic Knights Squads
of the Clover Kingdom?!

45:14.503 --> 45:18.173
We've been able to live
happily and peacefully

45:18.257 --> 45:21.427
thanks to the Wizard King
and the Magic Knights Squads!

45:21.927 --> 45:26.849
Before we joined, or when we were kids,
or even before we were born,

45:27.391 --> 45:30.436
the Magic Knights Squads
were fighting for us.

45:31.186 --> 45:36.442
And the Wizard King has stood
at the helm to protect this kingdom.

45:36.525 --> 45:39.945
It's thanks to those efforts
made by one person for another

45:40.028 --> 45:43.198
that the Clover Kingdom exists now.

45:43.282 --> 45:45.242
That's why we are here!

45:45.325 --> 45:46.452
Asta…

45:47.035 --> 45:48.996
I can't just sit and watch!

45:49.580 --> 45:50.789
It's my turn to protect

45:50.873 --> 45:55.252
what the Wizard King
and the captains have protected!

45:56.003 --> 46:00.424
But it's not just me. It's our turn!

46:01.008 --> 46:03.927
I can heal an injury like this
with my fighting spirit!

46:04.011 --> 46:07.765
And then I will kick his butt,
for real this time!

46:17.983 --> 46:20.527
With all of us, we can stop Conrad!

46:21.862 --> 46:24.698
We may not be strong enough by ourselves,

46:24.782 --> 46:28.368
but if we come together,
we can become an immense force!

46:29.536 --> 46:33.040
That's why we,
the Magic Knights Squads, are strong!

46:34.124 --> 46:36.960
If all the Magic Knights Squads
join their power,

46:37.044 --> 46:39.254
we could face any enemy!

46:40.506 --> 46:42.591
I'm not forcing you to come with me.

46:43.467 --> 46:44.927
Like Sekke said,

46:45.010 --> 46:48.555
you can still escape to the Heart Kingdom
or elsewhere if you go now.

46:49.139 --> 46:54.102
But if any of you
is willing to lend me your power…

46:56.647 --> 46:59.650
Jeez, what you suggest is so reckless.

47:00.567 --> 47:03.862
But coming from you, who's trying to do
the most reckless thing,

47:03.946 --> 47:05.072
I guess I can't say no.

47:17.918 --> 47:21.296
I'm not letting you go alone.
Not a chance.

47:27.928 --> 47:29.972
The Wizard King isn't here!

47:30.055 --> 47:32.307
We don't have the captains to rely on!

47:32.391 --> 47:34.518
But that doesn't matter!

47:35.018 --> 47:37.062
Now it's our turn to carry on!

47:37.145 --> 47:40.691
We'll fight on their behalf!

47:41.275 --> 47:42.317
I'll say it again.

47:42.401 --> 47:46.363
We are the Magic Knights Squads
of the Clover Kingdom!

47:46.446 --> 47:48.824
Right here, right now!
We'll surpass our limits,

47:48.907 --> 47:50.617
and protect this country!

47:50.701 --> 47:52.578
Yeah!

47:52.661 --> 47:54.955
And what is the actual plan?

47:55.038 --> 47:57.291
I'm going to figure that out now!

47:57.374 --> 47:58.584
What?!

47:58.667 --> 48:00.794
<i>I can't take this anymore, bwa-ha!</i>

48:01.628 --> 48:05.173
<i>Now that it has come to this,</i>
<i>I have to escape, even if it's just me!</i>

48:06.717 --> 48:07.593
Huh?

48:07.676 --> 48:08.802
Bwa-ha!

48:14.182 --> 48:15.392
Without any plans…

48:18.186 --> 48:21.899
Stop boasting, you imbecile!

48:31.992 --> 48:34.411
Lady Big-sis-leon! Everyone else, too!

48:34.995 --> 48:37.915
I didn't know you were alive! Ouch!

48:37.998 --> 48:40.792
Who are you calling "Big-sis-leon"?

48:40.876 --> 48:41.919
And don't assume I'm dead.

48:43.045 --> 48:45.631
I was away for training.

48:48.550 --> 48:49.593
But it seems…

48:50.719 --> 48:53.305
something fun is going on.

48:53.388 --> 48:56.934
I've also been away
on a mission with Jack.

48:58.518 --> 49:02.147
<i>Which is why I didn't get caught by</i>
<i>pursuers and was able to arrive here.</i>

49:03.523 --> 49:04.942
Same for me.

49:05.025 --> 49:07.110
We must go rescue everyone.

49:07.194 --> 49:08.445
Hehe.

49:08.528 --> 49:12.115
Some of the people who went on a mission
with us are fine as well.

49:12.991 --> 49:16.995
<i>They're out there,</i>
<i>surveilling that huge flying fortress.</i>

49:17.871 --> 49:21.458
<i>It looks like Yami</i>
<i>and the other captains are alive.</i>

49:22.042 --> 49:25.170
<i>They're trapped inside a barrier though.</i>

49:25.796 --> 49:26.630
Captain Yami!

49:26.713 --> 49:28.215
My brother Nozel!

49:28.298 --> 49:30.968
<i>Yami! I'm so glad!</i>

49:31.677 --> 49:33.136
But I don't get it.

49:33.220 --> 49:36.473
Why have the enemy captured
the citizens and the Magic Knights Squads

49:36.974 --> 49:38.225
but are keeping them alive?

49:38.850 --> 49:40.560
Because they need their magical powers.

49:41.061 --> 49:45.357
If they absorb power through the Sword
and supply it to their members,

49:45.440 --> 49:47.484
they will never run out of magical power.

49:47.567 --> 49:50.112
Hehe, so they're the feed.

49:50.195 --> 49:53.865
Oh man! He also mentioned
that he needs lots of magical power

49:53.949 --> 49:55.993
for his crazy ambition to come true!

49:56.576 --> 49:58.662
So that's why he's keeping them alive.

49:58.745 --> 50:01.581
So if their magical power runs out,
Yami and the others will be…

50:02.582 --> 50:04.126
We don't have much time left.

50:04.209 --> 50:05.669
Asta, everyone.

50:05.752 --> 50:08.505
Let's join forces
to take back this kingdom.

50:09.006 --> 50:09.965
-Yes, sir!
-Yes, sir!

50:10.048 --> 50:14.803
Before we do, we must eat-la!

50:24.521 --> 50:27.691
Oh! Charmy, you're okay!

50:27.774 --> 50:31.611
Yup. Thanks to Rouge and Captain Yami,
who let me escape.

50:32.571 --> 50:34.364
Oh! You all!

50:35.449 --> 50:37.200
Noelle, I'm glad you're okay.

50:37.701 --> 50:40.662
Our base was trapped
inside the barrier as well.

50:41.288 --> 50:45.000
Henry and Gordon are trapped inside,
but they're okay for now.

50:45.083 --> 50:46.168
Then,

50:47.377 --> 50:49.755
we gotta go get them, right?

50:51.089 --> 50:52.841
The base of the Black Bulls…

50:56.887 --> 51:00.098
The Imperial Sword has collected
the magical power of all the citizens,

51:00.182 --> 51:02.768
which will be driven into
a "singular point" vein of mana.

51:02.851 --> 51:07.064
Ha! Then that's the end for this kingdom.

51:07.147 --> 51:08.857
The enemy Wizard Kings

51:08.940 --> 51:12.778
must have been revived with
the Imperial Sword and Conrad's magic.

51:13.737 --> 51:18.283
So if we destroy the Imperial Sword,
do we stop the power of the Wizard Kings?

51:19.117 --> 51:21.286
Judging from Conrad's actions,

51:21.369 --> 51:22.788
that's highly likely.

51:23.955 --> 51:24.790
Very well!

51:24.873 --> 51:28.418
The final goal is to destroy
the Imperial Sword and neutralize it!

51:29.086 --> 51:32.214
Go and prepare for encountering the enemy!

51:32.756 --> 51:36.426
We don't have much time before dawn,
our time limit!

51:45.811 --> 51:48.271
<i>I still can't use</i>
<i>the spells in my grimoire,</i>

51:48.355 --> 51:51.358
<i>but thanks to Charmy,</i>
<i>my magic has returned.</i>

51:51.441 --> 51:55.028
<i>I'll focus on what I can do now!</i>

52:10.710 --> 52:11.545
Yuno!

52:16.716 --> 52:18.301
Are you ready, Asta?

52:19.010 --> 52:19.845
Yeah!

52:23.265 --> 52:26.852
BLACK BULLS SQUAD BASE

52:28.061 --> 52:31.773
This is strange. When I got back
from training, there was only Henry here.

52:31.857 --> 52:35.694
And former Wizard Kings have been revived,
and they've taken over the capital…

52:46.163 --> 52:48.039
I'm going to retake the base!

52:48.123 --> 52:51.168
First, we will go and rescue
those at the Black Bulls base.

52:52.544 --> 52:54.588
Are you sure?

52:54.671 --> 52:58.842
This plan depends on how much
fighting power we can preserve.

52:59.467 --> 53:03.972
For that, we need something that allows us
to move safely but in large numbers.

53:04.055 --> 53:04.890
I see.

53:05.765 --> 53:07.017
Don't you get it?

53:07.684 --> 53:09.853
At your base, that's possible.

53:10.854 --> 53:16.067
But Conrad is a formidable foe
who uses many types of magic at will.

53:16.693 --> 53:19.946
Normal magic attacks will be canceled out.

53:20.030 --> 53:22.240
And that's where you come in, Asta.

53:22.324 --> 53:27.287
Since you have Anti-Magic,
which neutralizes any kind of magic,

53:27.370 --> 53:29.956
only you have the chance to defeat Conrad.

53:30.665 --> 53:32.459
This is the key point of the plan.

53:32.959 --> 53:35.837
Please stop Conrad. Can I count on you?

53:36.880 --> 53:37.797
Yes, sir!

53:47.057 --> 53:48.391
All right!

53:49.684 --> 53:51.102
Welcome back, everyone.

53:51.645 --> 53:52.938
And we have so many guests…

53:53.021 --> 53:54.981
That's the story, Henry.

53:55.065 --> 53:57.317
Can you do it?

53:57.943 --> 54:01.196
Okay!

54:02.155 --> 54:06.910
Well then! You recover
the magic you lost by eating-la!

54:09.621 --> 54:16.211
I've never felt
this much magical power before!

54:38.900 --> 54:40.527
Cool!

54:40.610 --> 54:43.363
So this is the flying style
of the Black Bulls!

54:43.446 --> 54:46.491
Is this really going to fly?

54:46.574 --> 54:51.871
If there's enough magical power,

54:51.955 --> 54:53.665
I think it will--

54:58.545 --> 55:01.214
More than we expected, huh?

55:01.298 --> 55:02.716
Hehe!

55:02.799 --> 55:04.301
Severing Magic…

55:06.886 --> 55:10.056
Death Scythe: Lunatic Slash!

55:11.391 --> 55:13.101
Briar Magic…

55:13.893 --> 55:15.395
Crimson Vine Spear.

55:24.696 --> 55:26.573
A drop in a bucket, was it?

55:26.656 --> 55:29.075
Hehe! How annoying.

55:30.493 --> 55:31.494
What?!

55:31.578 --> 55:32.704
Bwa-ha!

55:39.627 --> 55:43.173
Hehe! Looks like this is worth severing!

55:43.882 --> 55:45.884
We will stop them here!

55:46.551 --> 55:48.887
You all go on ahead!

55:48.970 --> 55:51.306
Captain Jack! Captain Charlotte!

55:51.389 --> 55:53.016
This will be pointless if you go!

55:54.309 --> 55:56.311
But those two alone couldn't…

55:56.895 --> 55:58.688
It might be impossible, yes.

55:58.772 --> 55:59.606
Then,

55:59.689 --> 56:01.274
how about three?

56:09.366 --> 56:10.533
World Tree Magic…

56:11.159 --> 56:12.744
Great Mistilteinn Tree!

56:22.087 --> 56:23.963
Now, go while you can!

56:24.047 --> 56:25.298
Captain Vangeance!

56:25.382 --> 56:28.134
Are you ready?

56:50.907 --> 56:51.950
Yuno.

56:52.033 --> 56:53.993
I'm leaving the Wizard King in your care.

56:55.036 --> 56:56.121
Well then,

56:56.204 --> 56:58.665
let's have the barbarous guests leave.

57:05.088 --> 57:06.840
Listen up, everyone!

57:06.923 --> 57:10.176
We are minus three captains,
but we'll head into enemy territory…

57:10.760 --> 57:11.928
No, Asta.

57:12.011 --> 57:12.929
You tell them.

57:18.685 --> 57:20.937
Okay, let's go, everyone!

57:21.020 --> 57:22.772
We'll kick their butts

57:22.856 --> 57:25.984
and get the Clover Kingdom back!

57:26.818 --> 57:28.987
Yeah!

57:32.949 --> 57:35.452
A report from my soldiers.

57:35.535 --> 57:39.372
The rebels have started to move.
How shall I deal with them?

57:40.123 --> 57:41.624
So you're here.

57:42.792 --> 57:45.795
That's right. I knew you would come.

57:46.963 --> 57:48.882
It is time for the finale.

57:49.424 --> 57:51.634
I saved you the best seat.

57:52.510 --> 57:54.721
Is that why you kept me alive until now,

57:54.804 --> 57:56.890
even after I've lost most of my power?

57:56.973 --> 57:59.934
Those you love, those you want to protect.

58:00.477 --> 58:04.898
Burn into your eyes the image of
your trusted ones dying miserable deaths.

58:04.981 --> 58:08.443
Die as you agonize
over how powerless you are.

58:09.486 --> 58:12.530
This is the beginning
of a new Clover Kingdom.

58:12.614 --> 58:15.658
Let us turn a new page!

58:29.756 --> 58:32.383
What is that?!

58:34.469 --> 58:37.639
Whoa, it's enormous!

58:37.722 --> 58:42.393
It's incomparable to the one that was
at the Magic Knights Squad base!

58:42.477 --> 58:43.853
Everyone, look!

58:48.858 --> 58:54.781
Well, well, let me see
the last squeeze of power you have.

58:55.365 --> 58:56.533
And let me teach you

58:57.242 --> 59:01.538
that the Wizard King
is never caught off-guard!

59:09.045 --> 59:11.464
So, what are you going to do?

59:13.716 --> 59:16.386
This is the power of the Wizard King?

59:16.469 --> 59:19.222
It's in another league! What should we do?

59:20.098 --> 59:21.182
Asta!

59:22.600 --> 59:24.310
It's not your turn yet!

59:24.811 --> 59:27.272
What do we do?
More like, what don't we do?

59:27.355 --> 59:31.067
We've always surpassed our limits, right?

59:35.488 --> 59:37.198
Ready, you guys?

59:37.865 --> 59:40.410
-Let's show him what we're made of!
-Yeah!

59:40.493 --> 59:44.372
Flame Magic: Exploding Fireball!

59:44.455 --> 59:47.375
Lightning Magic: Thunderbolt Destruction!

59:47.458 --> 59:50.378
Poison Magic: Forbidden Fruit!

59:50.461 --> 59:52.589
Everyone!

59:53.089 --> 59:54.966
Are you ready?

59:55.049 --> 59:57.468
Yeah!

01:00:01.973 --> 01:00:05.018
Mirror Magic: Large Reflect Refrain!

01:00:08.479 --> 01:00:10.523
Go!

01:00:24.412 --> 01:00:26.873
Bwa-ha! Again?!

01:00:26.956 --> 01:00:28.082
Now's the chance!

01:00:28.166 --> 01:00:30.460
Spatial Magic: Fallen Angel Gate!

01:00:34.589 --> 01:00:35.465
Well, well.

01:00:35.548 --> 01:00:39.927
Whoa, whoa, we're about to arrive
at the enormous barrier!

01:00:40.428 --> 01:00:42.889
<i>The space is shut off from here on,</i>

01:00:42.972 --> 01:00:44.932
<i>so I can't break through with my magic.</i>

01:00:45.725 --> 01:00:47.685
<i>So, I'm counting on you.</i>

01:00:52.899 --> 01:00:54.734
<i>I know you can do this.</i>

01:00:55.360 --> 01:00:56.402
<i>Asta!</i>

01:01:09.499 --> 01:01:11.542
Stop running around!

01:01:15.546 --> 01:01:19.300
Thanks for voluntarily walking
into the trap.

01:01:19.384 --> 01:01:22.011
Magic like this will not--

01:01:22.095 --> 01:01:24.347
Sealing Magic: Eternal Prison!

01:01:25.848 --> 01:01:28.309
Finral, now! Do it quickly!

01:01:28.393 --> 01:01:31.562
Alright! Not said this in a while,
but remember I'm your senior!

01:01:32.730 --> 01:01:34.315
Good. Now…

01:01:41.989 --> 01:01:43.199
Didn't I tell you?

01:01:43.282 --> 01:01:45.118
I'm never caught off-guard!

01:01:59.215 --> 01:02:01.259
Thank you so much!

01:02:06.806 --> 01:02:11.894
Uh-huh? This special barrier has been
fortified with the Imperial Sword,

01:02:11.978 --> 01:02:15.648
so even if it gets broken,
it'll regenerate and not be a problem.

01:02:15.732 --> 01:02:21.195
To create the perfect world, we should
get rid of those who get in our way.

01:02:21.279 --> 01:02:23.030
This is the end!

01:02:23.531 --> 01:02:24.449
For you!

01:02:31.330 --> 01:02:34.751
I love it, I love it! Struggle for me.

01:02:34.834 --> 01:02:37.462
Mana Zone: Fangs of Riot…

01:02:37.545 --> 01:02:38.504
Double Attacks!

01:02:40.381 --> 01:02:42.175
Was that supposed to hurt me?!

01:02:42.759 --> 01:02:44.635
Now! Fire at will!

01:02:50.767 --> 01:02:51.976
One more time!

01:02:56.898 --> 01:02:59.358
Are you ready?

01:03:02.528 --> 01:03:04.781
I love it, you guys.

01:03:05.281 --> 01:03:06.324
Bring it on!

01:03:18.211 --> 01:03:21.380
-Go!
-Go!

01:03:30.973 --> 01:03:33.351
Ha! Are you serious?

01:03:33.434 --> 01:03:35.645
You guys are amazing!

01:03:36.479 --> 01:03:37.355
However!

01:03:38.731 --> 01:03:39.899
Everyone!

01:03:40.566 --> 01:03:42.151
I'm counting on you, Asta!

01:03:42.235 --> 01:03:44.487
You defeat him!

01:03:44.570 --> 01:03:47.949
Alright! I'm off!

01:03:50.493 --> 01:03:51.911
Hey, check that out.

01:03:52.578 --> 01:03:53.913
Conrad?!

01:03:54.497 --> 01:03:55.873
Why is he there?

01:03:56.874 --> 01:03:58.876
Oh, the singular point…

01:04:00.127 --> 01:04:02.672
Is it the skeleton of a demon?

01:04:06.509 --> 01:04:08.469
Uh-huh!

01:04:09.136 --> 01:04:12.932
Don't you dare get in our way!

01:04:20.773 --> 01:04:23.442
Asta! You go to Conrad!

01:04:27.113 --> 01:04:28.447
Give him all you got!

01:04:29.532 --> 01:04:30.533
Yeah!

01:04:42.879 --> 01:04:44.255
Let's go, Bell!

01:04:44.338 --> 01:04:45.172
I'm ready!

01:04:46.507 --> 01:04:47.717
Going all out!

01:04:56.851 --> 01:04:58.477
Spirit Assimilation…

01:04:58.561 --> 01:04:59.604
Spirit Dive!

01:05:03.691 --> 01:05:06.027
All units! Get into your positions!

01:05:06.110 --> 01:05:09.322
Just as planned, we succeeded
in splitting the enemy force!

01:05:10.740 --> 01:05:13.200
Now each of you will fight to the end

01:05:13.284 --> 01:05:16.120
with the pride of a Magic Knights Squad!

01:05:16.746 --> 01:05:19.707
If you don't,
then you have me to answer to!

01:05:20.333 --> 01:05:24.003
And not one of you
is allowed to die either.

01:05:24.921 --> 01:05:27.548
If you slack off, or if you die,

01:05:27.632 --> 01:05:29.717
then I will burn you to death myself!

01:05:31.594 --> 01:05:33.304
Listen well, all of you.

01:05:33.387 --> 01:05:34.972
If you don't want to die,

01:05:35.056 --> 01:05:37.266
then fight on, even if it kills you!

01:05:38.184 --> 01:05:40.102
-Let's go!
-Yeah!

01:05:42.146 --> 01:05:46.025
No tricks to speak of
for fighting against me?

01:05:46.108 --> 01:05:50.279
Just my luck to have
such a boring fool as my enemy.

01:05:50.363 --> 01:05:52.073
"Tricks"?

01:05:52.865 --> 01:05:55.284
Why would I need tricks to face you?

01:05:55.868 --> 01:05:57.328
Princia Funnybunny.

01:05:57.870 --> 01:06:01.791
A mighty warrior among the Wizard Kings,
whose combat strength

01:06:01.874 --> 01:06:03.876
is worth a thousand soldiers!

01:06:04.752 --> 01:06:07.755
The records say that you've never lost

01:06:07.838 --> 01:06:10.633
in any combat where you were involved.

01:06:11.217 --> 01:06:13.344
Why would I rely on some silly tricks

01:06:13.427 --> 01:06:16.055
when facing such a foe!

01:06:16.847 --> 01:06:19.350
Very well, I take back my words.

01:06:20.393 --> 01:06:23.312
Legion Magic: Endless Domination!

01:06:24.647 --> 01:06:26.983
If you want me to play with you,

01:06:27.066 --> 01:06:29.026
then show me your strength first.

01:06:35.366 --> 01:06:37.702
A test of strength?
I accept the challenge.

01:06:38.494 --> 01:06:42.498
But I hope you don't hold back on me!

01:06:55.344 --> 01:06:56.429
Next…

01:06:56.512 --> 01:06:58.305
Where are you aiming?

01:07:04.562 --> 01:07:08.274
Did you actually think
you managed to lure me in?

01:07:08.858 --> 01:07:10.776
Just the opposite, silly you!

01:07:10.860 --> 01:07:14.113
I'm the one who lured you here.

01:07:14.196 --> 01:07:15.823
The truth is,

01:07:15.906 --> 01:07:18.701
we can use the magical power

01:07:18.784 --> 01:07:22.079
that's fueling this flying fortress
as our own!

01:07:22.663 --> 01:07:24.540
So, as long as I'm in here,

01:07:24.623 --> 01:07:28.377
I can replenish my magic endlessly!

01:07:32.631 --> 01:07:35.051
And you think you've won just for that?

01:07:35.134 --> 01:07:36.469
Against us?

01:07:37.053 --> 01:07:37.928
"Us"?

01:07:38.971 --> 01:07:41.724
Hey, hey, Pretty Boy.

01:07:41.807 --> 01:07:43.934
Didn't anyone teach you

01:07:44.018 --> 01:07:46.979
that a damsel in distress
should be rescued gently?

01:07:48.064 --> 01:07:50.733
I'm a Virgo, you know!

01:07:52.276 --> 01:07:53.986
<i>The earlier attack…</i>

01:07:54.820 --> 01:07:56.655
<i>This is what he was aiming for.</i>

01:07:58.074 --> 01:07:59.200
I'll remember that.

01:08:00.034 --> 01:08:01.410
Are you ready to go?

01:08:01.494 --> 01:08:03.996
Can't have my subordinates taking risks

01:08:04.080 --> 01:08:07.666
without me, the captain,
surpassing my limits first, can I?

01:08:07.750 --> 01:08:09.210
Right, you guys?

01:08:10.753 --> 01:08:12.755
You don't need to tell me.

01:08:14.507 --> 01:08:18.177
We will show you the might
of the Magic Knights Squads, here and now!

01:08:18.260 --> 01:08:20.179
Yuno! We will back you up!

01:08:22.014 --> 01:08:24.058
You focus on attacking!

01:08:33.651 --> 01:08:34.902
Uh-huh?

01:08:35.444 --> 01:08:38.405
Don't make me yawn,
you nearly dead idiots.

01:08:39.073 --> 01:08:43.327
These guys here have been kept alive

01:08:43.410 --> 01:08:47.456
so that we could suck their magical power
to fuel the fortress.

01:08:47.540 --> 01:08:52.795
They have little magical power left.

01:08:53.295 --> 01:08:54.296
And?

01:08:54.380 --> 01:08:57.049
Is your grit going to help
regain your magical power?

01:08:57.883 --> 01:09:00.302
Huh? Surpassing limits?

01:09:00.386 --> 01:09:03.305
You can't get strong that quickly!

01:09:06.058 --> 01:09:09.353
You called yourself Wizard King
when you didn't even know that?

01:09:10.271 --> 01:09:11.313
Unbelievable.

01:09:12.898 --> 01:09:15.818
Bring it on, bastards!

01:09:15.901 --> 01:09:19.864
Flame Magic: Prison Death Scattershot!

01:09:44.680 --> 01:09:45.931
Here it is! Grey!

01:09:46.682 --> 01:09:48.851
Okay!

01:09:48.934 --> 01:09:51.395
Magic Conversion!

01:10:08.662 --> 01:10:11.207
Thank you…

01:10:11.290 --> 01:10:13.918
<i>I can't use strong magic,</i>

01:10:14.001 --> 01:10:16.003
<i>but I can manage this much</i>
<i>without my grimoire…</i>

01:10:16.086 --> 01:10:18.214
Looks like we can handle this.

01:10:18.839 --> 01:10:19.673
Right.

01:10:19.757 --> 01:10:23.135
The revived Wizard Kings
and the magic to destroy this kingdom…

01:10:23.219 --> 01:10:26.138
If Asta can touch the Imperial Sword
with his Demon-Slayer Sword,

01:10:26.222 --> 01:10:27.640
they can all be neutralized.

01:10:28.224 --> 01:10:31.310
All we have to do is to stop them
until he can do that!

01:10:33.229 --> 01:10:34.563
How pitiful…

01:10:36.065 --> 01:10:37.775
I'm saying this for your sake.

01:10:37.858 --> 01:10:39.068
Surrender now.

01:10:39.151 --> 01:10:43.948
And, please, leave
and go somewhere out of our sight.

01:10:45.074 --> 01:10:46.909
That's mighty nice of you.

01:10:47.493 --> 01:10:51.497
Isn't it your purpose to kill us off?

01:10:51.580 --> 01:10:58.170
If you were nobles and royals
who only think of benefitting themselves,

01:10:58.254 --> 01:11:00.005
then I'd have no mercy for you.

01:11:00.673 --> 01:11:05.177
But your hearts aren't impure like theirs.

01:11:05.719 --> 01:11:06.637
Retreat now!

01:11:07.221 --> 01:11:09.682
If you promise not to get in our way,

01:11:09.765 --> 01:11:11.433
I will let you go.

01:11:12.935 --> 01:11:14.436
That means,

01:11:14.520 --> 01:11:17.606
"Just shut up and watch
as this country breaks apart," right?

01:11:18.357 --> 01:11:19.191
In that case…

01:11:19.900 --> 01:11:22.695
We would not retreat even if it kills us!

01:11:25.781 --> 01:11:28.534
Being foolish is… pitiful.

01:11:30.035 --> 01:11:34.164
Ice Wedge Magic: World End Church.

01:11:42.506 --> 01:11:47.344
And here you thought you could beat me
with this level of magical power.

01:11:47.970 --> 01:11:49.596
My mana zone allows me

01:11:49.680 --> 01:11:53.350
to lower the temperature
of a space to below freezing!

01:11:56.061 --> 01:12:01.066
Amateurs won't be able
to even breathe in this space!

01:12:05.571 --> 01:12:07.489
Move…

01:12:07.573 --> 01:12:09.116
I don't understand.

01:12:09.199 --> 01:12:12.494
You were also oppressed by this world.

01:12:12.578 --> 01:12:15.497
Why do you reject our ideas?!

01:12:15.581 --> 01:12:17.249
Don't underestimate us…

01:12:18.083 --> 01:12:21.503
Everyone's giving their all to survive.

01:12:21.587 --> 01:12:24.465
Even if it's hard, they're not giving up!

01:12:25.090 --> 01:12:30.012
You have no right to take away
the lives of people like that!

01:12:32.598 --> 01:12:33.432
Indeed.

01:12:34.516 --> 01:12:37.144
<i>No one has the right to do so.</i>

01:12:37.770 --> 01:12:39.855
And that's why I must do what I must.

01:12:40.564 --> 01:12:43.442
In order to create a world
where those without magic

01:12:43.525 --> 01:12:46.320
and outsiders can smile as they live!

01:12:46.403 --> 01:12:48.530
But that doesn't justify--

01:12:50.032 --> 01:12:52.868
Being weak is also pitiful.

01:12:57.539 --> 01:12:59.750
Legion Magic: Blink Castling.

01:13:05.339 --> 01:13:09.385
It's useless. You will never reach me.

01:13:14.223 --> 01:13:15.641
Go to sleep.

01:13:16.433 --> 01:13:17.643
I refuse.

01:13:18.727 --> 01:13:21.647
I just need to burn everything down.

01:13:22.606 --> 01:13:23.857
Mana Zone…

01:13:23.941 --> 01:13:24.942
Full Release!

01:13:25.734 --> 01:13:26.902
Flame Magic…

01:13:28.821 --> 01:13:30.197
Calidos Brachium…

01:13:31.615 --> 01:13:32.866
Purgatory!

01:13:39.373 --> 01:13:40.416
Now!

01:13:41.625 --> 01:13:43.544
Time to play!

01:13:54.972 --> 01:13:58.559
Your name was Mereoleona, was it?

01:13:59.268 --> 01:14:01.895
You made me use my fist.

01:14:02.396 --> 01:14:05.816
You are very interesting.

01:14:20.038 --> 01:14:23.083
It's not often
that I get to use this on someone.

01:14:23.917 --> 01:14:26.211
Very good, Mereoleona.

01:14:26.295 --> 01:14:28.338
I will admit it.

01:14:28.422 --> 01:14:29.840
You are strong!

01:14:30.466 --> 01:14:34.136
But not as strong as me!

01:14:37.639 --> 01:14:39.141
What are we going to do, Yuno?

01:14:39.224 --> 01:14:41.727
At this rate,
Yami and the others won't last.

01:14:41.810 --> 01:14:42.686
I know!

01:14:51.111 --> 01:14:52.404
Captain Nozel!

01:14:55.866 --> 01:14:58.619
Yuno, don't try to do something you can't.

01:14:59.119 --> 01:15:00.537
You are strong.

01:15:01.246 --> 01:15:03.790
Try and face
what you are capable of right now.

01:15:05.751 --> 01:15:08.128
Don't worry about us.

01:15:18.055 --> 01:15:20.307
Please buy me a little more time!

01:15:23.852 --> 01:15:25.562
I'll finish him with the next blow!

01:15:32.736 --> 01:15:35.489
Hey, hey, beardy macho man!

01:15:35.572 --> 01:15:37.908
Did you run out of energy at the start?

01:15:40.369 --> 01:15:42.204
Your taste in nicknames is horrible!

01:15:44.623 --> 01:15:46.124
No matter how you look at it,

01:15:46.208 --> 01:15:49.795
I'm obviously more of
a "cute and girly" kind of macho!

01:16:22.786 --> 01:16:24.246
Don't you know any other moves?

01:16:32.087 --> 01:16:33.005
<i>This guy…</i>

01:16:33.589 --> 01:16:37.009
<i>He's pouring all his magical power</i>
<i>into this blow!</i>

01:16:46.184 --> 01:16:48.061
You powered your way through after all.

01:16:48.937 --> 01:16:51.398
A rather unrefined move, Pretty Boy!

01:17:01.992 --> 01:17:05.662
Aren't you interesting?!

01:17:20.302 --> 01:17:26.016
So you've been protecting
this land all these years…

01:17:28.810 --> 01:17:30.312
Lemiel.

01:17:30.395 --> 01:17:32.731
The world you envisioned,

01:17:33.815 --> 01:17:36.151
I will make it come true.

01:17:38.320 --> 01:17:41.490
Conrad!

01:17:42.574 --> 01:17:46.036
So you've arrived, Asta!

01:17:48.455 --> 01:17:51.124
You were a little too late, Asta.

01:17:54.044 --> 01:17:54.878
This is…

01:17:54.961 --> 01:17:55.879
Stop!

01:17:55.962 --> 01:17:57.381
…the end.

01:18:05.806 --> 01:18:10.227
And a new beginning for this world!

01:18:36.420 --> 01:18:38.171
Give up, Asta.

01:18:38.255 --> 01:18:41.925
I drove the magic of the Imperial Sword
into the singular point.

01:18:42.008 --> 01:18:46.763
No one can stop
the destruction of this kingdom!

01:18:52.394 --> 01:18:53.770
Not yet!

01:18:55.021 --> 01:18:57.941
I'll pull that sword out
and kick your butt!

01:18:58.483 --> 01:19:00.318
I'm really persistent.

01:19:00.402 --> 01:19:03.155
If I decide to do something,
I'll do it even if it kills me!

01:19:03.238 --> 01:19:05.449
It's you who should give up!

01:19:06.158 --> 01:19:09.786
Then you understand me, Asta.

01:19:13.874 --> 01:19:17.210
-Never giving up is my magic!
-Never giving up is my magic!

01:19:24.593 --> 01:19:27.721
If someone like you had been around me,

01:19:27.804 --> 01:19:30.974
then my loneliness
may not have been as bad,

01:19:32.684 --> 01:19:34.728
Mereoleona.

01:19:41.526 --> 01:19:42.360
Hey.

01:19:46.865 --> 01:19:48.116
The battle…

01:19:50.702 --> 01:19:52.704
is not over yet!

01:19:57.417 --> 01:19:58.335
<i>Impossible!</i>

01:19:58.418 --> 01:19:59.628
<i>Her power increased?!</i>

01:20:00.545 --> 01:20:01.379
You!

01:20:02.005 --> 01:20:03.381
How can you still move?

01:20:06.176 --> 01:20:07.302
Ugh, Big-sis-leon.

01:20:07.385 --> 01:20:08.970
What's up! Lady Mereoleona!

01:20:09.054 --> 01:20:11.139
Good morning, big sister!

01:20:11.223 --> 01:20:13.433
Good morning, Lady Mereoleona!

01:20:14.810 --> 01:20:15.685
Big sister!

01:20:20.732 --> 01:20:21.942
It's my grit!

01:20:23.568 --> 01:20:24.903
Also,

01:20:24.986 --> 01:20:27.572
if I kick the bucket in a place like this,

01:20:28.365 --> 01:20:32.327
they'll surely laugh at me!

01:20:50.262 --> 01:20:51.972
And one more thing!

01:20:53.139 --> 01:20:55.267
Unless I stay the strongest,

01:20:56.393 --> 01:21:01.064
I won't be able to call
a certain someone "my rival"!

01:21:03.650 --> 01:21:07.028
Drawing strength from your comrades…

01:21:07.529 --> 01:21:10.824
That sure is a trick I'll never learn.

01:21:11.408 --> 01:21:12.409
However…

01:21:15.704 --> 01:21:17.581
Well done, Mereoleona.

01:21:18.540 --> 01:21:21.084
To think that I'd lose in a fist fight.

01:21:22.252 --> 01:21:23.420
You just might be

01:21:24.421 --> 01:21:27.883
strong enough to fight me
when I go all out!

01:21:29.384 --> 01:21:33.054
Oh man, you're really strong.

01:21:33.138 --> 01:21:35.599
You even made me use my trump card.

01:21:36.349 --> 01:21:39.102
Had I met you when I was the Wizard King,

01:21:39.185 --> 01:21:41.855
I might have made you my advisers.

01:21:41.938 --> 01:21:43.106
Maybe!

01:21:46.192 --> 01:21:48.945
You are wrong!

01:21:50.530 --> 01:21:51.865
Don't give me that crap.

01:21:51.948 --> 01:21:57.871
No one knows
what's right and what's wrong!

01:21:58.580 --> 01:22:00.248
We're the same as you!

01:22:00.832 --> 01:22:06.129
Conrad and I, we fight for our beliefs!

01:22:09.090 --> 01:22:10.508
I get that!

01:22:10.592 --> 01:22:13.720
In a fight like this,
there's no right or wrong!

01:22:15.513 --> 01:22:17.390
But to protect what matters to us…

01:22:19.100 --> 01:22:21.394
we both plant our feet and fight!

01:22:21.978 --> 01:22:22.979
Combo Spell…

01:22:23.480 --> 01:22:24.940
Dimension Slash!

01:22:25.482 --> 01:22:26.733
Scorching Light!

01:22:40.872 --> 01:22:41.915
I won't lose…

01:22:42.749 --> 01:22:45.794
I won't lose to something like this!

01:22:45.877 --> 01:22:47.545
That's too bad!

01:22:47.629 --> 01:22:50.131
Asta, I'm borrowing your skill!

01:22:51.132 --> 01:22:54.803
I hate losing more than anything too!

01:23:11.569 --> 01:23:13.321
Whatever.

01:23:13.905 --> 01:23:17.075
I don't care about preserving
magical powers for the fortress anymore.

01:23:17.951 --> 01:23:23.832
I'll use all my power to crush you all!

01:23:31.631 --> 01:23:33.425
Reconsider, Asta.

01:23:34.801 --> 01:23:38.847
This crazy world is not worth protecting.

01:23:39.681 --> 01:23:43.601
Let's build a new world together!

01:23:48.189 --> 01:23:50.775
I don't care about your new world!

01:23:51.443 --> 01:23:54.362
My dream is to become the Wizard King!

01:23:55.030 --> 01:23:55.864
Nonsense.

01:23:56.698 --> 01:24:00.076
Becoming a Wizard King in this world
will change nothing.

01:24:01.828 --> 01:24:02.954
That's right.

01:24:03.038 --> 01:24:04.247
Nothing…

01:24:43.495 --> 01:24:46.081
All routes are shut down.

01:24:47.415 --> 01:24:49.918
Your sword will never reach me.

01:24:50.752 --> 01:24:52.170
No matter how you struggle,

01:24:52.253 --> 01:24:54.506
this is your limit.

01:24:56.257 --> 01:24:58.426
I'll say it one last time.

01:24:59.177 --> 01:25:00.845
Come with us, Asta.

01:25:02.847 --> 01:25:05.391
You can be my successor.

01:25:06.142 --> 01:25:08.478
Become the Wizard King in the new world.

01:25:15.318 --> 01:25:17.445
Not in a million years!

01:25:17.529 --> 01:25:20.698
Someone can't turn you
into the Wizard King.

01:25:20.782 --> 01:25:23.326
You become one on your own merits!

01:25:23.409 --> 01:25:26.287
And there is a way!

01:25:27.997 --> 01:25:29.374
If there isn't,

01:25:31.042 --> 01:25:32.669
I'll make one!

01:25:37.215 --> 01:25:42.053
I've always been told
to surpass my limits!

01:25:48.893 --> 01:25:51.729
That was a good hit.

01:25:52.522 --> 01:25:54.566
So I didn't parry and took it.

01:25:55.650 --> 01:25:57.986
Along with your ambition.

01:26:00.071 --> 01:26:02.574
But playtime is over, Asta.

01:26:03.241 --> 01:26:05.743
If we can't walk the same path together,

01:26:05.827 --> 01:26:08.329
then there is no point
in holding back anymore.

01:26:08.413 --> 01:26:09.789
Asta.

01:26:09.873 --> 01:26:15.837
The biggest reason I asked you to join us
is not because of your power.

01:26:16.504 --> 01:26:19.674
Nor is it because
you were in the same boat as me.

01:26:20.675 --> 01:26:23.720
I wanted you,
who has the same ambition as me,

01:26:23.803 --> 01:26:25.763
to be rewarded!

01:26:27.015 --> 01:26:30.560
But I was not able
to open your eyes to the truth.

01:26:32.103 --> 01:26:33.354
How regrettable…

01:27:14.729 --> 01:27:16.648
<i>I'm neutralizing him with my Anti-Magic,</i>

01:27:17.482 --> 01:27:18.650
<i>but I can't keep up!</i>

01:27:23.238 --> 01:27:24.489
Now!

01:27:28.117 --> 01:27:29.535
I've been waiting

01:27:30.119 --> 01:27:33.539
for the moment you'd take it easy
and drop your guard!

01:27:33.623 --> 01:27:36.042
Exploding Fireball!

01:27:37.252 --> 01:27:40.755
From there, Flame Bondage Formation!

01:27:43.549 --> 01:27:44.926
Full Reflection!

01:27:52.016 --> 01:27:54.102
Ice Wedge Magic…

01:27:54.644 --> 01:27:56.646
World End Martyr!

01:28:03.987 --> 01:28:05.571
This is what…

01:28:06.406 --> 01:28:08.866
"taking it easy" means!

01:28:12.412 --> 01:28:15.707
You learn something new every day,
don't you, young one?

01:28:17.083 --> 01:28:18.710
Thanks for nothing, old fart!

01:28:19.711 --> 01:28:21.462
<i>Hurry up, Asta!</i>

01:28:21.546 --> 01:28:24.340
<i>Our magic won't last much longer!</i>

01:28:25.550 --> 01:28:27.343
Black Hurricane!

01:28:29.679 --> 01:28:33.099
It's admirable how you can
keep your spirits up,

01:28:33.182 --> 01:28:35.351
but your movements are getting slow!

01:28:38.980 --> 01:28:41.107
One Horn Bull Thrust!

01:28:47.697 --> 01:28:50.491
No matter how much you struggle,

01:28:51.117 --> 01:28:53.494
this gap between us will never be filled!

01:28:54.704 --> 01:28:57.123
This is the power of the Wizard King!

01:29:03.880 --> 01:29:05.256
I will never…

01:29:05.882 --> 01:29:10.553
acknowledge a guy like you
as the Wizard King!

01:29:11.721 --> 01:29:15.141
<i>Crap, if I let my guard down,</i>
<i>my Black form will become undone.</i>

01:29:15.641 --> 01:29:18.770
<i>I need to land a hit</i>
<i>with everything I've got left!</i>

01:29:18.853 --> 01:29:22.106
Stop seeing your dreams
in the Wizard King!

01:29:22.190 --> 01:29:24.776
No one, not even the first Wizard King,

01:29:24.859 --> 01:29:28.780
has been able to bring
revolution to this kingdom.

01:29:28.863 --> 01:29:31.574
In fact, far from changing the nation,

01:29:31.657 --> 01:29:35.036
Julius ended up getting beaten
by the Elves in the earlier war,

01:29:35.119 --> 01:29:39.040
and the Clover Kingdom
almost faced its doom.

01:29:39.123 --> 01:29:42.168
They can't protect anything.
They can't change anything.

01:29:42.251 --> 01:29:45.671
Wizard Kings are utterly useless!

01:29:46.798 --> 01:29:48.174
That's not true…

01:29:50.927 --> 01:29:56.057
The current Wizard King protected
all the citizens in exchange for his life!

01:29:56.599 --> 01:29:58.309
Same with the first Wizard King!

01:29:58.393 --> 01:30:01.687
He protected everyone
at the expense of his life,

01:30:01.771 --> 01:30:03.940
and even after that,
for hundreds of years,

01:30:04.524 --> 01:30:06.818
he kept on sleeping

01:30:07.693 --> 01:30:11.989
so he could help us and this country!

01:30:16.244 --> 01:30:22.208
<i>Clover leaves each represent</i>
<i>faith, hope, and love.</i>

01:30:23.167 --> 01:30:25.878
<i>Within the fourth leaf dwells good luck.</i>

01:30:27.046 --> 01:30:30.299
<i>In the fifth leaf resides the devil.</i>

01:30:33.803 --> 01:30:36.013
Is he about to die again?

01:30:36.597 --> 01:30:38.641
Man, what a piece of work.

01:30:38.724 --> 01:30:42.854
I guess I'll get the payment
in a lump sum later.

01:30:46.566 --> 01:30:48.067
You became the Wizard King

01:30:48.151 --> 01:30:52.113
because a lot of people acknowledged you,
didn't you?

01:30:52.947 --> 01:30:56.242
Betraying those people
makes you unfit to be one!

01:30:57.326 --> 01:30:58.953
I won't acknowledge you!

01:31:00.913 --> 01:31:05.042
Wizard Kings inspire people!

01:31:05.710 --> 01:31:09.005
They can be someone's hopes and dreams!

01:31:09.088 --> 01:31:11.132
They are not useless at all!

01:31:13.593 --> 01:31:17.513
You don't understand
the true nature of this country yet.

01:31:18.181 --> 01:31:21.601
The discrimination and prejudice
rampant in this country

01:31:21.684 --> 01:31:25.271
have crushed people's dreams
and hopes again and again!

01:31:25.354 --> 01:31:29.650
Unless we make a fundamental change,
this country will not change!

01:31:30.234 --> 01:31:32.695
That's not for you to decide!

01:31:33.613 --> 01:31:34.489
Right now,

01:31:34.572 --> 01:31:37.575
regardless of their social status,
everyone from peasants to royals

01:31:37.658 --> 01:31:41.329
is working hard together
to make this a better country!

01:31:41.871 --> 01:31:43.664
So don't get in our way!

01:31:43.748 --> 01:31:46.918
A country cannot change
with such simple measures!

01:31:47.001 --> 01:31:49.504
Don't get in my way!

01:31:54.509 --> 01:31:57.553
What the hell?
I'm not sure what's going on,

01:31:57.637 --> 01:32:00.973
but I feel like
I finally got to talk to the real you.

01:32:02.141 --> 01:32:03.309
Shut up.

01:32:04.018 --> 01:32:09.232
I'm no longer interested in listening to
pipe dreams from a kid who knows nothing!

01:32:13.819 --> 01:32:17.114
<i>Crap! My Black form is coming undone!</i>

01:32:17.198 --> 01:32:20.618
True, there was a time
when I trusted the country and its people

01:32:20.701 --> 01:32:25.873
and tried to bring changes
to the Clover Kingdom as the Wizard King.

01:32:25.957 --> 01:32:28.626
But people betray you.

01:32:28.709 --> 01:32:31.128
You must know what that's like.

01:32:31.712 --> 01:32:35.258
Just because a small portion
of your community changed,

01:32:35.841 --> 01:32:39.512
do you seriously think
that a whole country will change?

01:32:40.346 --> 01:32:41.847
It's not that they change.

01:32:42.348 --> 01:32:44.517
It's that we bring change together!

01:32:44.600 --> 01:32:46.269
The world you're trying to create

01:32:46.352 --> 01:32:50.856
is an egotistical world
where you're the only one who's laughing!

01:32:51.357 --> 01:32:54.777
I want to laugh with everyone.
I want to become happy with everyone!

01:32:55.653 --> 01:32:59.907
I will change this country with everyone!

01:32:59.991 --> 01:33:02.243
A country where everyone who lives there

01:33:02.326 --> 01:33:05.496
respects each other
and laughs with one another!

01:33:05.580 --> 01:33:09.500
That's what I'm going to create!

01:33:20.511 --> 01:33:22.680
My magic is back!

01:33:26.017 --> 01:33:27.393
Noelle!

01:33:32.273 --> 01:33:35.318
Water Creation Magic: Valkyrie Armor!

01:33:35.401 --> 01:33:37.069
Yeah!

01:33:37.153 --> 01:33:38.487
What a futile struggle.

01:33:38.988 --> 01:33:42.658
You defying us only pushes us
away from an ideal world!

01:33:43.159 --> 01:33:44.869
Why can't you see that?!

01:33:46.912 --> 01:33:49.081
An ideal world

01:33:49.165 --> 01:33:51.667
isn't something that's forced upon you.

01:33:52.168 --> 01:33:54.170
It's something you earn yourself!

01:33:55.171 --> 01:33:56.922
Noelle! Look at me!

01:33:59.175 --> 01:34:00.343
Mirror Magic…

01:34:01.052 --> 01:34:02.678
Mirror Brigade!

01:34:05.556 --> 01:34:08.351
<i>I used to resent this world as well.</i>

01:34:08.934 --> 01:34:11.520
<i>I couldn't learn to control</i>
<i>my magical powers</i>

01:34:11.604 --> 01:34:13.522
<i>and was abandoned by my family.</i>

01:34:13.606 --> 01:34:16.734
<i>I thought I was alone in the world.</i>

01:34:18.027 --> 01:34:20.655
<i>But I now have friends</i>

01:34:21.572 --> 01:34:24.283
<i>who make me feel I belong!</i>

01:34:24.825 --> 01:34:26.702
<i>They accept me with my shortcomings,</i>

01:34:27.953 --> 01:34:32.500
<i>and they stay right beside me</i>
<i>as we move forward!</i>

01:34:33.584 --> 01:34:35.127
<i>Combo Spell…</i>

01:34:35.961 --> 01:34:37.630
<i>Mirror Meteo…</i>

01:34:40.925 --> 01:34:41.759
<i>Dragon!</i>

01:34:45.346 --> 01:34:47.515
Magic Conversion!

01:34:47.598 --> 01:34:49.600
Ice to Water!

01:34:50.935 --> 01:34:52.395
Right here, right now…

01:34:54.230 --> 01:34:55.398
<i>Fate Manipulation…</i>

01:34:55.481 --> 01:34:56.774
<i>Absolute Evasion!</i>

01:34:56.857 --> 01:34:59.568
<i>Spatial Magic: Fallen Angel's Wingbeat!</i>

01:35:00.486 --> 01:35:03.155
I will surpass my limits!

01:35:06.992 --> 01:35:08.285
Jeez.

01:35:08.369 --> 01:35:09.912
Just go already!

01:35:09.995 --> 01:35:12.164
Leave it to me!

01:35:16.252 --> 01:35:18.421
The world can be changed.

01:35:19.046 --> 01:35:21.716
Fate can be manipulated!

01:35:23.050 --> 01:35:25.886
I will not let you destroy

01:35:26.637 --> 01:35:32.685
even the possibility of it!

01:35:49.160 --> 01:35:50.911
How about that?

01:35:50.995 --> 01:35:54.665
If that's not enough for you,
then I can do this all day.

01:35:56.250 --> 01:35:57.084
But…

01:36:00.755 --> 01:36:03.549
Start over with us, together.

01:36:04.967 --> 01:36:06.469
I don't mean to boast,

01:36:07.052 --> 01:36:09.805
but I can't do anything
without everyone's help!

01:36:10.556 --> 01:36:13.017
I nearly died many times,

01:36:13.100 --> 01:36:16.604
but I was able to come this far
with their help!

01:36:16.687 --> 01:36:17.855
Shut up!

01:36:21.859 --> 01:36:24.904
I want to create a world where everyone
can laugh together in a way

01:36:24.987 --> 01:36:27.490
that everyone can accept.

01:36:29.074 --> 01:36:32.328
If you have to kill
a lot of people to create it,

01:36:32.828 --> 01:36:35.581
no one will accept that!

01:37:06.278 --> 01:37:08.531
You… What is your name?

01:37:08.614 --> 01:37:11.033
Noelle. Noelle Silva.

01:37:11.116 --> 01:37:13.536
From the royal house of Silva…

01:37:14.495 --> 01:37:15.329
I see.

01:37:16.539 --> 01:37:18.207
You're a good girl, Noelle.

01:37:19.208 --> 01:37:22.962
You're a royal, and yet
you can empathize with the weak.

01:37:24.129 --> 01:37:27.550
If a person like you exists,
then surely this world…

01:37:30.719 --> 01:37:32.555
Hey, hey, hey…

01:37:33.722 --> 01:37:36.308
Are you serious, Conrad?

01:37:38.435 --> 01:37:40.813
I can still fight!

01:37:42.189 --> 01:37:43.357
Me too.

01:37:44.692 --> 01:37:48.237
But it looks like
it's my turn to go to sleep.

01:37:49.572 --> 01:37:51.699
It was a lot of fun.

01:37:56.662 --> 01:37:57.496
I did it…

01:37:58.122 --> 01:37:59.039
I did it!

01:37:59.623 --> 01:38:00.457
Everyone!

01:38:02.042 --> 01:38:03.919
Not… yet…

01:38:06.130 --> 01:38:07.715
Not yet…

01:38:10.551 --> 01:38:15.973
It's a forbidden spell
that's activated in exchange for my life.

01:38:17.474 --> 01:38:19.518
Doom's Gate.

01:38:28.611 --> 01:38:31.405
I will not give up.

01:38:31.488 --> 01:38:33.490
I will not give up, Asta.

01:38:48.881 --> 01:38:52.384
I will… not give up either.

01:38:53.677 --> 01:38:56.388
I'm going to be the Wizard King.

01:38:57.431 --> 01:39:01.644
In order to be the Wizard King…

01:39:03.062 --> 01:39:04.396
I am!

01:39:05.064 --> 01:39:08.233
Right here!

01:39:09.485 --> 01:39:10.903
Asta!

01:39:16.992 --> 01:39:18.786
Asta, take this.

01:39:21.246 --> 01:39:22.206
The Wizard King!

01:39:22.998 --> 01:39:25.167
You won't need an explanation.

01:39:25.876 --> 01:39:27.670
That sword will show you.

01:39:28.462 --> 01:39:30.005
The future of this nation…

01:39:30.089 --> 01:39:30.923
The space…

01:39:31.840 --> 01:39:33.008
…is in your hands.

01:39:38.263 --> 01:39:39.098
<i>I feel it.</i>

01:39:39.974 --> 01:39:42.643
<i>This is everyone's power!</i>

01:39:43.686 --> 01:39:45.104
<i>Their hopes and dreams!</i>

01:39:49.692 --> 01:39:50.734
<i>I feel everyone…</i>

01:39:51.777 --> 01:39:53.112
<i>everyone is there!</i>

01:39:55.280 --> 01:39:57.700
Master Nacht, please stop it!

01:39:58.450 --> 01:40:03.205
You've been working non-stop
since you got back to the Clover Kingdom!

01:40:03.914 --> 01:40:08.168
If you give away your magical power
on top of that, you'll pass out!

01:40:08.252 --> 01:40:10.462
I don't mind passing out

01:40:11.964 --> 01:40:15.884
if that means someone
who's doing the right thing gets rewarded.

01:40:18.971 --> 01:40:19.930
<i>Right here…</i>

01:40:20.639 --> 01:40:21.473
<i>Right now…</i>

01:40:22.808 --> 01:40:23.809
<i>Let's all…</i>

01:40:27.062 --> 01:40:30.065
surpass our limits.

01:40:34.611 --> 01:40:35.738
The Imperial Sword?

01:40:36.530 --> 01:40:38.532
What is going on?

01:40:42.077 --> 01:40:43.996
Go, Asta!

01:41:01.597 --> 01:41:04.099
With this…

01:41:14.568 --> 01:41:18.781
You bastard, how badly
do you want to destroy this country?!

01:41:18.864 --> 01:41:20.824
Oh, you have no idea!

01:41:20.908 --> 01:41:22.284
It needs to be destroyed!

01:41:23.077 --> 01:41:25.120
This nation is rotten to its core.

01:41:25.621 --> 01:41:29.166
The very foundation of it
needs to be destroyed.

01:41:29.249 --> 01:41:34.046
I have to save everyone. I must!

01:41:34.129 --> 01:41:39.343
Who exactly do you mean by "everyone"?!

01:41:39.426 --> 01:41:43.138
All those who are unreasonably oppressed!

01:41:43.222 --> 01:41:45.516
For their sake, I…

01:41:57.486 --> 01:41:58.570
I will…

01:41:59.947 --> 01:42:01.406
I will…

01:42:05.536 --> 01:42:08.080
Even if you're a peasant
or don't have magical power,

01:42:08.163 --> 01:42:10.582
you can be stronger
than anyone else in the world.

01:42:11.416 --> 01:42:14.086
You can be everyone's hope!

01:42:14.670 --> 01:42:17.506
And to prove it…

01:42:21.593 --> 01:42:22.678
I am going to be

01:42:23.220 --> 01:42:24.847
the Wizard King!

01:42:51.623 --> 01:42:54.960
<i>Did I… lose?</i>

01:42:56.837 --> 01:42:58.797
<i>Then why…</i>

01:42:58.881 --> 01:43:02.092
<i>why do I feel so at ease?</i>

01:43:07.890 --> 01:43:10.017
<i>Now I see it.</i>

01:43:11.185 --> 01:43:14.271
<i>Asta. Become the Wizard King.</i>

01:43:14.354 --> 01:43:20.903
<i>Share that warm world of yours</i>
<i>with every citizen in this nation.</i>

01:43:21.904 --> 01:43:24.907
<i>Never giving up is your magic.</i>

01:43:25.407 --> 01:43:26.575
<i>I know you can…</i>

01:43:29.912 --> 01:43:31.330
<i>You all…</i>

01:43:43.008 --> 01:43:44.843
<i>I see.</i>

01:44:07.658 --> 01:44:09.243
Cheerful and honest,

01:44:09.826 --> 01:44:12.871
he knew how to empathize with the peasant.

01:44:13.538 --> 01:44:18.293
Conrad used to be
a strong, kind man like Asta.

01:44:19.461 --> 01:44:22.089
But he was framed by the royalists,

01:44:22.172 --> 01:44:25.384
and ever since his squad
and his wife were slaughtered,

01:44:26.009 --> 01:44:27.594
he changed.

01:44:30.013 --> 01:44:31.056
Asta.

01:44:31.139 --> 01:44:32.891
Thank you for stopping him.

01:44:34.434 --> 01:44:38.939
Why was I able to use
the Imperial Sword at the end?

01:44:39.022 --> 01:44:39.898
What do you mean?

01:44:39.982 --> 01:44:43.402
When I hit the Imperial Sword
with my Demon-Slayer Sword,

01:44:43.485 --> 01:44:46.113
the magic of the Imperial Sword
must've been neutralized.

01:44:46.989 --> 01:44:48.198
So I was wondering…

01:44:50.075 --> 01:44:52.077
Well, that's because…

01:44:56.248 --> 01:44:58.583
<i>Generations of Wizard Kings…</i>

01:45:01.336 --> 01:45:05.590
…generations of Wizard Kings
lent you their miraculous power.

01:45:05.674 --> 01:45:08.927
Wow, that sounds so cool!

01:45:09.011 --> 01:45:11.346
Silly, he's teasing you.

01:45:11.430 --> 01:45:12.723
That's not true!

01:45:12.806 --> 01:45:15.142
<i>Generations of Wizard Kings.</i>

01:45:15.225 --> 01:45:19.563
<i>The clovers responsible for the future</i>
<i>of this kingdom are growing up nicely.</i>

01:45:19.646 --> 01:45:22.482
-You making fun of Prince Lemiel?
<i>-</i>How about it, Asta?

01:45:23.275 --> 01:45:25.152
The Wizard King is incredible, right?

01:45:25.235 --> 01:45:26.403
I knew that, sir!

01:45:26.486 --> 01:45:29.489
And one day,
I'll be that incredible myself.

01:45:30.073 --> 01:45:31.616
I will become the Wizard King!

01:49:31.064 --> 01:49:32.857
Don't you be slacking here.

01:49:32.941 --> 01:49:35.235
I worked my butt off, you know?!

01:49:39.197 --> 01:49:41.032
The place was a total shambles,

01:49:41.116 --> 01:49:44.119
but it looks like things might be
restored sooner than I thought.

01:49:44.202 --> 01:49:45.245
Yeah.

01:49:50.041 --> 01:49:52.752
Conrad was the Wizard King, too, huh?

01:49:54.504 --> 01:49:55.338
Ouch!

01:49:56.506 --> 01:49:57.340
Not a chance.

01:49:59.634 --> 01:50:00.468
You're right!

01:50:02.137 --> 01:50:04.264
I'm going to be the Wizard King, anyway.

01:50:04.347 --> 01:50:05.682
No, I will!

01:50:05.765 --> 01:50:07.267
I'm going to be the Wizard King!

01:50:07.851 --> 01:50:09.936
-Can't hear you.
-Don't ignore me!

01:50:10.020 --> 01:50:11.646
Wanna go?

01:50:11.730 --> 01:50:13.732
The Triumph was canceled,

01:50:13.815 --> 01:50:16.776
but you and me gotta settle this match!

01:50:18.194 --> 01:50:19.279
Not a chance.

01:50:26.870 --> 01:50:29.581
I'm going to be the Wizard King!
